<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">AYUBU - Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ayub</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="imt3">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Ayubu chamlanga mntu yumwenga mkanuni naketangwa Ayubu, uyo hata hegu ahumisaga, mna hakoile masa ya kumfuzumila Chohile. Ayubu 1:22. Hahana hata mntu yumwenga amanyize awandikaga ichitabu cha Ayubu hegu chawandikagwa umo ini, mna vyadahika kugamba Ayubu atendekaga kekala mwe ichipindi ichiya wekalaga awakale saviya Abulahamu, kwaviya ekalaga mwe imihilimo 140. Wata kuwandika walozize hawakufanyanya kugamba Ayubu mwenye nuyo awandike chino ichitabu. Mta kuwandika mtuhu hekumanyika kafanyanya kugamba ni vyedi kuzitamwila na kuziwandika izimbuli za Ayubu. Chitabu chino cha Ayubu china mbuli za masulumizo. Shetani kamtende Ayubu asulumizwe kafanyanya kugamaba ivyo navimtende Ayubu aleke kumvikila Zumbe Chohile (Ayubu 1:12). Ntendele nkulu ye ichitabu cha Ayubu chatambalisa kugamba Ayubu na wambuyaze nawakalafya kwambwani Ayubu asulumizwa. Wambuyaze dya Ayubu nawazumila kugamba Ayubu asulumizwa kwaviya kakola masa, mna Ayubu nakazumila kugamba yeye ni mkuka hakoile masa. Mbuli izo zize ziheze, Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga na Ayubu, mwe mbuli zose ahumise Ayubu halongile zihiye za kumhuluta Chohile. Ayubu eze abunkule kugamba Chohile adaha kudamanya chochose akunga na kugamba mntu hakudaha kukombaganya mbuli nkulu za maula akudamanya Chohile, Ayubu niyo ajimbikwa vituhu ni Chohile kwa ugoli ulozese na wana. Vimndani mwe ichitabu cha Ayubu 1. Sula ya 1 na 2 zatambalisa ulailo wo ukusulumizwa kwa Ayubu uhoswa ni Shetani. 2. Kukongela sula ya 3 kubula sula ya 37 zachigambila mbuli nawakalafya Ayubu na wambuyaze zo ukusulumizwa kwakwe Ayubu. 3. Mwe isula ya 38 kubula sula ya 42:6 Chohile alonga na Ayubu, Ayubu naye amhitula Chohile. 4. Mwe isula ya 42:7-17 chagambilwa kuhona kwa Ayubu, wikazi na ivyo Chohile amjimbike Ayubu mo udumo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Shetani amjeza Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Hendaga na mntu yumwenga mwe isi ya Usi, akwitangwa Ayubu. Mntu uyo endaga hena lema naho achumile, mntu akumtunyisa Chohile naho mta kwenega wavu. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Ayubu endaga na wana mfungate wa chigosi na watatu wachiche, <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />endaga na ngoto elufu mfungate, ngamia milongo mitatu elufu, ngo'mbe elufu imwenga, naho endaga na mpunda magana mashano. Naho endaga na wandima walozese uyo endaga mgoli kujinka awantu wose uko koulailo we idizuwa. <verse eid="JOB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Chila nkanana wanawe dya Ayubu nawakagonekana mwe inyumba ya chila yumwenga ywawo, iviya wawagoneka walumbu zawo watatu chani weze wadye na kunywa hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Chila ichinyemi icho chikaheza, Ayubu nakawetanga wanawe chani awakukize. Nakenuka mtondo chilochilo, niyo alavya ntambiko ya kutikimya kwa chausa cha chila yumwenga ywawo kwaviya nakafanyanya kugamba wadaha watende wakola masa ya kumhuluta Chohile mwe izifanyanyi zawo. Yano yendaga ni mazwela ya Ayubu. <verse eid="JOB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Ivyo zuwa dimwenga wandima wa kwembingu waitaga kudugana na Chohile, Shetani naye niyo eleviza hamwenga nawo kulongozi kwa Chohile. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Chohile niyo amuza Shetani, “Weye walawa kuhi?” Shetani niyo amhitula, “Nalawa kwe kutalamka mwe isi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Vikaheza Zumbe niyo amgamba, “Togola! Kumuwona undima ywangu Ayubu?” Mwe isi yose hamna mndima sauyo Ayubu hana lema kachuma mta kumogoha Chohile naho enega mbuli za wavu. <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Shetani niyo amhitula Zumbe Chohile, “Wafanyanya kugamba Ayubu akuvikila vya vyabule? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Weye humdimile ntendele zose hamwenga na awantu we ikaya yakwe na chila chintu ananacho. Weye kumjimbika mwe chila chintu ananacho naho ugoli wakwe ujenyele mwe isi. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Mna haluse, hake musize chila chintu ananacho, naye nakuligite kulongozi kwako!” <verse eid="JOB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Shetani, “Wadaha kudamanya chochose ukudaha mo ugoli wakwe, mna yeye mwenye usekumkufya.” Ivyo Shetani niyo ahalawa halongozi ha Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanawe dya Ayubu wakomwa na ugoli wakwe wabalangwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Zuwa dimwenga wanawe dya Ayubu nendile wakadya na kunywa divai mwe inyumba ya mkulu ywawo. <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />Elo, mndima yumwenga kaita akaguluka kwa Ayubu na kumgamba, “Nendile chikalima kwa majembe yakubuluzwa ni ng'ombe. Izimpunda nazo nazikadya aho haguhi. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Chipumpa Waseba niyo wachebunga nakuwaguha awanyama na kuwakoma awandima kwa bamba. Ni miye ichedu nichulupuke hwigaile ulosi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Ahadya henati kubinda ukulonga, mndima mtuhu engila na kugamba, “Lumwemwe na lubaula vyoka izingoto zako zose na kukoma awandima wako. Ni miye ichedu nichulupuke hwigaile ulosi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Ahadya henati kubindiliza ukulonga, mndima mtuhu niyo engila na kugamba, “Mabunga matatu ya Wakalidayo wazebunga izingamiya, niyo waziguha na kuwakoma awandima wako kwa bamba ukaleka miye du. Ni miye ichedu nichulupuke hwigaile ulosi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Ahadya henati kubinda ukulonga, niyo mndima mtuhu eza akaguluka, amgamba, “Wanawo wa chilume na wa chiche nendile wakadya na kunywa divai mwe inyumba ya mkulu ywawo, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />chipumpa luzimu niyo lwajinka kulawa kwe dijangwa. Niyo lwaitowa inyumba iyo chila ntendele niyo yawagwela, wabwanga wose wabanika. Ni miye ichedu nichulupuke hwigaile ulosi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo achimala atatula izisuche zakwe. Niyo awegula izifili zakwe, edula hasi hesanga na kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />Akagamba, “Nelekagwa mwe isi sine chintu, naho nanibanike sine chintu. Chohile kaninka haluse kaguha. Naditunywe idizina dyakwe!” <verse eid="JOB 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Mwe zimbuli zino zose Ayubu hadamanye masa naho hamfanyanyize uhezi Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Shetani amjeza Ayubu vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Niyo kwalaila zuwa tuhu, wana wa Chohile waitaga kudugana kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, niyo Shetani elavyanya naho hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amuza Shetani, “Weye walawa kuhi?” Niyo Shetani amhitula, “Nalawa kwe kutalamka na kuzunguluka mwe isi.” <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amuza, “Togola kumuwona mndima ywangu Ayubu?” Hahana mntu mtuhu mzumizi mwe isi akwinga uyo. Uyo ni mntu achumile, mta kumvikila Chohile mta kumtunyisa Chohile naho enega mbuli za wavu. Nimkanuni kubula vino dyelo, hata hegu weye kunigamba nimkome vya bule, mna Ayubu katogesa mo uzumizi. <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Shetani niyo amhitula Zumbe Chohile, “Mazuwa yose mntu adima umwili wakwe, alavya chila ananacho chani ahonye ujima wakwe. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Mna haluse hake mlumize umwili wakwe, nakugambila nakuhulute pwilili!” <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Ivyo Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Shetani, “Ni vyedi, uyo emwe udahi wako, mna unase kumkoma.” <verse eid="JOB 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Vikaheza Shetani niyo ahalawa ho ulongozi wa Zumbe Chohile, akumwebunga Ayubu kwa maihu yakutumbuka nkwenje kukongela ko lwayo lwe chiga kubula kwedifofo. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ayubu niyo aguha bendu dya zae eyagila izi nkwenje zakwe akatenda kekala mwe chivu. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Mkaziwe niyo amgamba, “Togola weye uche nouzumizi wako? Ni mbwani hwikumhuluta Chohile chani ubanike?” <verse eid="JOB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Ayubu niyo amhitula, “Weye walonga saviya wavyele wahezi! Hadya Chohile akachigaila yedi, chayazumila. Nimbwani chilemele hadya akachigaila yehiye?” Mwe zimbuli izo zose Ayubu halongile dyodyose dikumwihiza Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambuya watatu wa Ayubu wamtalamkila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Wambuya watatu wa Ayubu wendaga, ni Elifazi kulawa kweisi ya Temani na Bilidadi kulawa kweisi ya Shuwa na Sofali kulawa kweisi ya Naamasi. Weza weve ayo yambwile Ayubu, wawona wakamtalamkile nakumwinka hai. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Umo wachei hale niyo wamwona Ayubu, mna hawambunkule. Ivyo, niyo wakonga kuguta kwa izwi na kwila, watatula izisuche zawo, niyo wafilisa lumbi mo ulanga na mlanga mwe mitwi yawo. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Vikaheza niyo wekala hadya eli Ayubu kwa mazuwa mfungate chilo na msi, hahana alongile ulosi wowose, kwaviya wawona kugamba nana masulumizo yatendese.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu afuzuma kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Eze yomboke ayo Ayubu niyo akonga kulonga, na kuligita idizuwa elekagwa.<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Ayubu niyo agamba,<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Nadiligitwe idizuwa nelekagwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">Ichilo chiya vilongigwe, Nda ya mwana chilume inulwa.<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Chohile ajele chiza idizuwa idyo, Chohile asekudikumbuka vituhu idizuwa idyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">naho kusekutenda na ulangazi mwe idizuwa idyo.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Kutende na chihovu na chiza chizamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">kutende na maingu yazamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">naho zuwa disekwaka.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Ichilo icho chitende na ziza kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">chise kuwazwa mwa amazuwa yo mhilimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">naho chisekujelwa mo uwazwa we imyezi.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Ichilo icho kusekutendeka na mvyele nenula nda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">izwi dya mbwedo disekwivika mndani mwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Watu wamanyize kuligita nawaligite idizuwa idyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">wadya wamanyize kulongoza Lewiyasani wadisetule dyebunge idizuwa idyo.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Ntondo za machelo zififiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">chilo icho chibese kupata ulangazi mna chisekupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">naho chisekuwona ung'azi wa kucha.<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />Chiligitwe ichilo icho kwa kunileka nelekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">kwa kunitenda nitende na nkunto na masulumizo.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Nabesa nabanikile mwe inda ya mnala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">hegu ahadya nize nelekwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Ni mbwani vilekile mnala anigate mwe iviga vyakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">Ni mbwani vilekile anonkeze?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Kwaviya aho nasigona kutondowala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">nasigona ntongo na kupata ntulwe,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />nasigona saviya wadya amaseuta ne ivilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">wezengelaga mazumba ya chisekulu.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Naho nasigona saviya maseuta wamemeze izinyumba zawo na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">na mayuwe ya chumbu,<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />hegu nimbwani sitendile saviya nda ibanikile kundani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">heye saviya lutiti luwiye kunyuma.<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Mwe isi ya wabanike wantu wavu waleka uwihi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">na wantu wasokele wehumwila.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Uko, hata wafungwa wabweda utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">hawakwiva lwasu lwa maizwi ya wachimaila wa wantu wafungigwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Uko weyuko wakulu kwa wadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">wamanyikise na hewe manyikise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">na watumwa wose walekeilwa kwa masekulu wawo.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Kwambwani umwinke ulangazi mntu emwe nkunto?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">Na kuwenka ujima wata chinyulu.<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />Wantu wabesa wabanike mna hawa kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">wakulonda mbila ukaleka ugoli wefisize.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Awo wamema mbwedo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">na kuvina hadya wakawona imbila?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Elo, ni mbwani nijendeleze kutenda mjima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">uneva Chohile kanichinda nisekujendeleza no ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">sikudaha kuwona uko hwita.<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Ukaleka kudya naila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">mesozi yangu yajuluzika uge mazi mwe mto.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Chila chintu hogoha chinipata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">chiya huwonela nkama nicho chikunilaila.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Sina utondowazi, hegu ntulwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">nkunto zangu hazina udumo.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi akonga kulonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Vikaheza yudya Elifazi mntu ywa Temani niyo amgamba Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />Togola, mntu anajeza kukugambila mbuli nawihiwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Ni yuhi akudaha kwechinda asekulonga? <verse eid="JOB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Weye kuhinya wantu walozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">naho kuwambiza wasokezi watende na nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Milosi yako iwambiza wafile chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">kuwambiza wakale saviya vikuwagila.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Haluse kugwelwa ni nkunto wafa chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">yakubwila weye wasokela.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Togola kumvikila Chohile gamba nuyo umsuhi wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">Na uchumi wo umoyo wako gamba nuwo ulunda lwako?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Haluse fanyanyisa ni yuhi asulumizwe akatenda hana lema?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Hegu wantu wachumile wagwelwe ni nkunto?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Ivyo miye nimanyize wakuhanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">wavu na wihi nivyo nawavune. <verse eid="JOB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Awo wakomwa ni Chohile kwa muye wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:9">awo awakoma kwa maya yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Wantu wavu wabuma saviya simba nkali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">mna ameno yawo yavunwa.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Simba idalahale yafa kwa kuswesa maingo, na wana simba fyele wamwaganikana.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Zuwa dimwenga, nagambilagwa mbuli chinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">miye siva chiya alongile.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Hatenda hagatigati he fanyanyi sozi za chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">umo wantu watozizwe ni ntongo folilo,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Nasitozwa ni nkama na chizingizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">mavuha yangu yose yazingiza.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Mpeho niyo yavumila mo uso wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">malaika mo umwili wangu niyo yachimala. <verse eid="JOB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Siwona chintu chichimale kulongozi kwangu chinyamala dwii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">nichikaule sidunduga kuchibunkula ni chibwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">Kwendaga na chintu chisiku kulongozi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">nakunyamala dwii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">vikaheza niyo neva izwi dikulonga. <verse eid="JOB 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />“Togola, mntu adaha kutenda mkanuni kumjinka Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Mntu adaha kutenda ywedi kujinka Mumbi ywakwe? <verse eid="JOB 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Hata amalaika wakwe, Chohile hana ukanuni nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">na awandima wa kwembingu awawona hawachumile. <verse eid="JOB 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />Togola wafanyanya adaha aikiye msuhi mwe mntu aumbigwe kwa ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">uyo nkongelo yakwe ni lumbi wakudaha kuhondwa saviya sondo?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Mtondo chadaha kutenda wajima mna chisingi vyadahika chabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">ikabula chisingi chadaha kubanika wantu hewevimanyize.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Vyose chinanavyo vinosika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">chabanika hechine umanyi.”<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Haluse Ayubu itanga, ukaule hegu kuna akunga akwitikile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Ni yuhi mwa awandima wa kwembingu ukunga umwitange?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Chindendi tumbwaziko dyakoma humbwinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">na chinyulu chambalanga mhezi.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Simwona humbwinya akachumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">mna chipumpa niyo naligita uwikazi wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Wanawe wehale no utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">awo wabunyanywa kwe ivitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">naho hahana mta kuwagombela.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Ulozo wakwe wadigwa ni wata sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">hata nkande ihotile mwe miwa, yadigwa ni wata sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">wata tama wameila mate ugoli wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Kwaviya nkunto haikulawa mwe msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">naho chivuwanya hachikusuka mwe ulongo.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Mna mntu elekwa apate nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">saviya masese ya moto yakupilika kulanga.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Hegu nendile weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">nasilalama kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">nasimwigaila uyo Chohile idilaho dyangu.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Uyo akudamanya maula makulu heyekudahika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">akudamanya mpituko hezikuwazika.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Isi ainyeseza fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">egala mazi kwe izinkonde.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Wakunyanyahala awenula kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">w kulomboleza awenka mbwedo.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Abalanga myalo ya wantu wadanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">ntendwa zawo zisekuchumilwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Umo wantu wapapa wakajesa upapala wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">na mizungu ya wakankalu asunguza kuibalanga.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Awo waona chiza chipindi cha mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">nomsi wahahasa uge ni chilo.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Mna Chohile awambula wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo wasekukomwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">awapempula wasokezi kulawa mwe mikono ya wata nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Ivyo wachiwa wana msuhi, na ubunyanyi wadumizwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />Mbwedo wi mwe mntu akukantilwa ni Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">Elo, ukagololwa ni Chohile Mta Nguvu usekubela.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Adaha kuhosa ulumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">akaheza auguza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">na kwa mkono wakwe ahonya.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Hata hegu nkomano mtandatu zikakulaila uyo nakwambule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">heye hata mwe mfungate hahana ubanasi naukupate. <verse eid="JOB 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Mwe chipindi cha gumbo nakwambule mwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">mwe nkondo nkulu nakwambule.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Chohile nakudime kulawa mwe kwebungwa ni mahuluto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">naho hawogohe ubanasi ukwiza.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Chipindi cha nkunto na sala weye noseke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">naho hawogehe makala ye mweisi.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Hodunduge kulima mwe nkonde ina mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">makala ya kumbago hayakwebunge.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Nauwone mwe inyumba yako mna utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">nolaule uludimo lwako, lose nowone lwiyaho.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Iviya welekwa wako nowawone nawatende waloza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">waloza uge mani mwe isi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Nobanike ukatenda mdalahala achintile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">uge iso dya ngano ikududulwa inyaile vyedi.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Elo, uno nuwo uzuza wetu, naho ni chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">elo uwive kwaviya naukwambize.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu ahitula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula Elifazi<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />Hegu usungu wangu wahimigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">na amasulumizo yangu yose na kwikwa hamwenga mwe chihimo,<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />nayazama kujinka msanga wa mpwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">Nivyo vikuleka imilosi yangu yavavanya.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Kwaviya misale ya Chohile Mta Nguvu inilasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">usungu wakwe wenela mo mwili wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">Kutisa kwa Chohile kunibwila.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Togola! Mpunda yaila ikatenda na mani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">Hegu Ng'ombe yaila ikatenda na funcho dya mani?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Togolani, Chintu hechine mwile chadaha kudigwa hehana munyu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">Togola ujinji wa tagi una mwile wowose?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Sina nkwina ya kuzidya izinkande izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">izo ni nkande zikunihiza.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Nahaunga Chohile aninke chiya hunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">elo, Chohile aninka chiya humeila mate!<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Kugamba Chohile aungile kunihonda honda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:9">elo, anikomile mwenye!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Atendile ivyo, vino haluse nasihozwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">heye, naselelwa mo ulumi wangu utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">sikanile imilosi yakwe uyo Mkuka.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Mna sina nguvu ya kujendeleza no ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">hahana luhosa lolose lwa miye kujendeleza kutenda mjima.<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Togola, miye sumbwa kwa mayuwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">Hegu mwili wangu wisaviya shaba?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Mwangu hamna cha kunambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">wambizi wose mwangu uswa.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />Mntu akatenda emwe nkunto egamila kujelwa moyo ni wambuyaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">hata hegu kaleka kumvikila Chohile mta nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Mna nyuwe wambuya zangu, hamnambize umo haunga wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">mwi saviya wamto wakusunguza kunyala.<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Wamemile balafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">seluji yefisa mndani mwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Mna kukakola moto ibalafu yalujuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">chipindi cha chizuwa vimto ivyo vyanyalisa.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Mafyo ya wata mayombe yaga sila kwa kulonda mazi, yakwela kwenyika na kufila uko.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Mafyo ya watafi wa Tema waga wakalonda mazi, watafi wa Sheba waika msuhi wa kupata mazi.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Wehiwa kwa kugoja bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">wabula mwe ivimto ivyo na kuwona maya.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Nyuwe mtenda seiyo ivimto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">mwawona amabuli yangu yakutisa mogoha.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Togola, sigamba mninke jeleko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">Hegu mlavye ugoli wenyu chani nihone?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Hegu mnikombole mwe mkono wa mnkondo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">Hegu mnikombole mwe mikono ya manyakwili?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Nihinyani, nami naninyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">nigambilizani aho nibalange.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Milosi ya chindedi ina nguvu nkulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">Mna mahigano yenyu yalagisa mbwani?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Togolani mwafanyanya mwadaha kuliganya imilosi nilongile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">Milosi ya mntu afile chevu ni mpeho du.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Nyuwe mwadaha kutoa tegatega mumpate abanikilwe ni welesi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">mwadaha kuwataga wambuya zenyu chani mtende wagoli!<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Mna hampu nikaulani mo uso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">Miye sanilonge udanti kulongozi kwenyu.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Naweilani lekani maya, msekutenda na wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">haluse lekani kunilaha kwaviya miye nimntu ywedi.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Togolani, mwafanyanya kugamba silonga udanti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">Togolani mwawafanyanya kugamba miye sikudaha kubunkula dyedi kulawa mwe yehiye.<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Wikazi wa wantu ubuka udala muno mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">chila zuwa waungwa wadamanyise ndima saviya wantu wahakilwe njemo,<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />saviya mtumwa akubesa chizuli cha mpeho ya chisingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">naho ni saviya mndima ahakilwe akugoja amaliho yakwe kwa nkwina.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Miye sina cha kwikiya msuhi mwe imyezi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">miye vilo vyose nengilwa nusungu.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Hagona hasi nafanyanya naninuke ini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">kwaviya izisa za nechilo zatendesa ntali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">nagalagala mo lusazi kubula kwacha.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Umwili wangu umema funduku na uzavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">inkanda yangu inyala na kutumbuka ufila.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Mazuwa yangu yasunguza kujinka saviya fingili dya mta kusuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">yabula udumo wakwe hehena msuhi.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Weye Chohile kumbuka wikazi wangu ni saviya muye du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">miye saniwone mbwedo vituhu.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Akuniwona vino haluse haniwone vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">ukakunisinya du nantende sihalawa kale.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Saviya ingu dikufifia na kusika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">nivyo awantu wakubanika hawakuya vituhu.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Akuhalawa hakuya vituhu kwa awantu we ikaya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">wantu wamjalisa.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Elo! Saninyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">nanilonge kwa amasulumizo ye mo umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">nanilalame ko usungu wo untu wangu.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Togola, miye ni bahali, hegu kaladuke dya mwe ibahali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">Nimbwani wanikiya wamizi wanidime?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Umo hagamba nanigone lusazi lwangu nalunihoze umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">ne idifumbi dyangu nadihunguze ulumi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />Mna weye weza kunijela nkama mwe sozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">wanitisa kwa kunigaila uwoni,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />hata najelejeza nenyulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">nawona ni vyedi kwefila ukaleka kujendeleza mwe yano amasulumizo.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Wikazi wangu nawihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">sanikale mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">Nilekani, kwaviya wikazi wangu sicho chintu.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Wantu ni chintu chani vikuleka wawatunduliya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">Ni mbwani wetumbwadisa kwachausa chawo?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Weye wawapelemba chila mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">chila nkanana weza kuwajeza.<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Nojendeleze kunikaula kubula ini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">hehena kunileka hadodo?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Hata hakola masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">weye walumila hahi weye ukuzuza wantu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Nimbwani kunika tailo dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Togola miye sitenda mzigo kwako?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Ni mbwani hukunilekeila amasa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">na kunusiza uwavu wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Kwaviya ahano hajihi nanigonezwe mwedilumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">nonilonde mna sanitendeke.<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Vikaheza Bilidadi mntu akulawa Shuwa, niyo amhitula Ayubu, <verse eid="JOB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />Nolonge izimbuli izo kubula ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">Imilosi yako naitende ibule saviya mpeho kubula ini?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Togola wafanyanya Chohile azaganya uwagila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Hegu Chohile Mta Nguvu ahituila ichindedi chitende udanti?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Uneva wanawo wamkola masa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">uyo kawalihiza ulailo wo ubanasi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Mna uneva unamlonda Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">na kumweila uyo Chohile mta nguvu,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />uneva weye umoyo wako ukuka naho wekala saviya akunga Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">chindedi Chohile neze akwambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">na kukwinka hantu hakukuwagila.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Hata hegu nakukonga na vijeche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">wikazi wako aho nyumani nautende wo ugoli.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Hampu hina kwa wadya wachilongoile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">kombaganya izimbuli wabunkule awo awadalahala.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Suwe chelekwa ivino mazuzi du hachimanyize dyodyose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">amazuwa yetu muno mwe isi ni saviya chizuli chikujinka.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Leka wakale wakuhinye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">na kukugambila mbuli wawonaga mo umanyi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Togola manywenywe yadaha kuhota hantu hehena mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">matete yatima hehena mazi.<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Umo yachei yajendeleza kukula naho hayakantigwe ni mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">manywenywe ayo yanaswesa mazi yasunguza kunyala ukaleka mani matuhu.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Nivyo weli wose wakumjala Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">hewekumzumila Chohile msuhi wawo waga.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Chiya wakwefenyeza hachiwambize chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">msuhi wawo nisaviya lutando lwa bwilili.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Dyegamila utando wakwe mna haukuchimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">walung'ang'anila mna haukudindimala.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Mntu mta masa ni saviya manywenywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">kunatenda na mazi matambi yakwe yazagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">kukalawa zuwa yanyala.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Amaizi yakwe yezingiliza mwe luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">na kwetogeza mndani mwe izinyuwe.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Mna wanang'olwa kulawa ahantu hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">awo hawoneka kugamba hahendaga na wantu.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Kaula uwo nuwo udumo wo mbwedo wo mntu uyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">na ahantu hawo nawelekwe watuhu.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Kaula, Chohile hamlemele mntu hena lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">naho hawambize wantu wavu.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Mna nakwinke chinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">na kutula chizumo cha mbwedo,<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />mna wadya wakukwihiwa nawajele soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">na wikazi wa wantu wavu hautendeke vituhu.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amhitula Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo ahitula, <verse eid="JOB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />Chindedi simanya kugamba nivyo vili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">Mna mntu adaha vivihi kutenda mkanuni kulongozi kwa Chohile?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Uneva mntu anajeza kuhigana naye hakubula hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">hadahe kuhitula mbuli imwenga mwe mbuli elufu.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Chohile ni mmanyi naho ana nguvu zitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">hahana ahigane naye niyo ahuda.<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Magulu ayasamiza yoyo yenye hayamanyize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">ayabidula kwa maya yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Uyo aisingisa isi kulawa ahantu hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">na kuzitenda izinguzo zakwe zizingize.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Adaha kulagiza idizuwa disekutontomoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">ne izintondo zisekulangaza.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Uyo ichedu atantalika izimbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">na kujata amawimbi ye bahali.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Chohile nuyo azidamanye izintondo koulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">zikwitangwa Dubu na Olioni na Kilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">ne izintondo zi kwamwenye mzi.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Nuyo akudamanya mabuli makulu heyemanyike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">na mpituko hezikuwazika.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Kaula! Zumbe Chohile ajinka haguhi na miye sikudaha kumwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">vikaheza aita zakwe hehena kumbunkula.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Aguha chiya akunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Ni yuhi akudaha kumchinda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Ni yuhi akudaha kumuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">“Weye watenda mbwani?”<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Chohile hachinde amaya yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">Hata idibunga kulu dya awagomba nkondo we idizoka Lahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">dina nguvu wafika madi heviga vyakwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Elo, nadaha vivihi kumhitula Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">Milosi ya kumhitula naisagula kuhi?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Hata hegu sina lema sikudaha kumhitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">vyaungwa nimlombeze anifile mbazi uyo Chohile mlamuzi ywangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Hata hegu namwitange niyo anitikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">sadahile kukombaganya kugamba anitegeleza.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Uyo egala nkung'unto inihonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">ajenyeza nkwenje zangu hehena mbuli.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Hakunileka niheme hata hadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">wikazi wangu kaumemeza chinyulu.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Hegu ni mbuli za nguvu uyo ana nguvu zitendese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Hegu ni mbuli hungwa nipate, ni yuhi akudaha kuhigana na Chohile mwe chitala?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Hata hegu sina lema imilosi yangu yanikantila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">hata hegu sina katitu, Chohile nanilavyanye kugamba ni mwavu.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Hata hegu sina lema, mna sikweunga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">Wikazi wangu nawihiwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Yose niyamwenga nivyo vikuleka nagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">Chohile awabalanga wedi na wehiye.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Uneva nkomano inaleta file kwa chipumpa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">uyo atila ukufa chevu kwa yudya hene idilema.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Hadya isi ikulongozwa ni wantu wehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">uyo ayagubika ameso ya walamuzi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Uneva Chohile hadamanye ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">elo, ni yuhi adamanye?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />Mazuwa yangu yaguluka kujinka mta kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">yaguluka hehena kupata mbuli zose.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Yasunguza kujinka saviya ngalawa ikugulukisa mwe mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">saviya mpungu dikukumpukila maingo yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Uneva hagamba nanijale ukugula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">nuse uso wangu wo kuholola utende wa mbwedo,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />nichei na nkama ne ichinyulu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">kwaviya simanya Chohile haniwone kugamba sina lema.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Uneva nnakantilwa kugamba nna lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">nimbwani netumbwadise vyabule?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Hata hegu nanekunte kwa mazi yang'alise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">na kwekukiza imikono yangu kwa sabuni,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />hata ivyo nanijele mwe bome dina uzavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">hata izisuche zangu naziniwone chinyala.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Chohile suyo mntu samiye nidahe kumhitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">hachikudaha kwita hamwenga naye kwechitala chikalahane.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Hahana mntu mwivanyi mgati mwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">akudaha kuchilamwila suwe waidi.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Hahana akudaha kumchinda Chohile asekunikantila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">Kutisa kwako kusekunijela nkama!<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Aho nahadaha kulonga naye hehena nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">mna kwaviya semanya ivyo nili mo umoyo wangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Wikazi wangu nawihiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Mafuzumo yangu nayalonga pwilili hehana kufisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">nanilonge kwachausa cho usungu wo umoyo wangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Nanimgambe Chohile asekunikantila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">Nigambila! Nichibwani icho ukunilaha?<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Togola, kwako ni vyedi ukanizila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">Kubela indima ye imikono yako udamanye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">Na kuhingiza mizungu ya wantu wavu?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Togola, weye una meso uge mntu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 10:4">Wasinya vintu saviya akusinya mntu?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Togola, amazuwa yako yenga ya wantu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">Hegu imihilimo yako yenga saviya chili suwe?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />Elo, ni mbwani ukulonda uwavu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">na kuzuza chila masa yangu?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Weye kumanya kugamba miye sina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">naho hahana akudaha kunambula mwe imikono yako.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />Imikono yako niyo initonyange na kunitenda vino nili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">mna haluse wanihituka na kunibalanga.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Kumbuka kugamba kunumba kwa ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">Togola, nonivuze vituhu mwe lumbi?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Togola, weye hunijuluze uge mele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">na kunigandiza uge mabongo?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Kunumba umwili wangu kwa mavuha na nyuje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">niyo wagubika amavuha yangu kwa nyama na nkanda.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Kuninka ujima na kunitendela yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">mo kunidima kwako kuhonya iloho yangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Mna izimbuli izo kuzifisa mo umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">miye simanya kugamba uwo ni mwalo wako.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Nokagoja uwone hegu nanikole masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">chani ulemele kunilekeila uwavu wangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Uneva miye ni mwavu, nanluwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">hegu ni mkanuni sikudaha kweduvya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Kwaviya simema soni hakaula amasusulumizo yangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Uneva nnetenda ni mkankalu wanongola saviya simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">na kunilagisa udahi wako ukutisa mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Chila nkanana waniletela waukukuzi wanihige,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">amaya yako mwangu yajenyela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">wanikiya wantu hewekununga wanebunga.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />Chohile, ni mbwani ukanileka nelekwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Naviwagila nefile du wantu hewenati kuniwona.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Natendile uge mntu hetendeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">naguhigwe kulawa mweinda na kwigalwa kwe mbila.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Togola amazuwa yo wikazi wangu gamba ni majeche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">Nilekani nibwede hadodo.<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />Sinati kwita uko sanuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">uko kwe isi ina masulumizo na chiza chikulu,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />isi ya chihovu na ngavungavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">hantu hadya ulangazi wakwe ni chiza.<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">Milosi ya Sofali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Vikaheza Sofali kulawa komzi wa Namasi, niyo amhitula Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />Togola, imilosi ino ilozize ilekwe du isekuhitulwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Togola, mntu mta milosi ilozize alagisa kugamba hana lema?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Togola, imilosi yako ye chihezi naiwanyamaze wantu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">Hegu unatila hahana mntu na kukwahile?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Weye wagamba, viya ukulonga ni chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">naho wimkuka kulongozi kwa Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Nabesa Chohile alonge!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">Alavye izwi dyakwe akuhitule. <verse eid="JOB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />Uyo akugubwile chinyele cho ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">kwaviya ubala wa chindedi haukumanyika vihufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">Mna waungwa uvimanye Chohile kakulekeila masa yako masiku.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />Togola, wadaha kubunkula ichinyele cha Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">na kumanya umhaka wakwe Chohile mta nguvu?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Ukulu wakwe Chohile wajinka izimbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">weye wadaha chibwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">Chohile kamanya hata idibome hedine uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">weye kumanya chibwani?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Ukulu wa Chohile ni mtali kujinka utali we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">naho ni wangalamu kujinka ibahali.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Uneva Chohile anajinka na kumjela mntu mwe chifungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">na kumkantila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">ni yuhi akudaha kumchinda?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Chohile kawamanya wantu hewekuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">naho awona uwavu wawo.<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Mhezi hakudaha kutenda na umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">mpunda miliya naisigale kutenda mpunda miliya du.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Ayubu unautenda umoyo wako uchume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">inula imikono yako na kumlombeza Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Uneva una wavu uleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">usekuzumila wihi ukekala mnyumba mwako.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Aho, nowelavize kulongozi kwa wantu hwina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">notenda kutoga naho hwina nkama.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Nkunto zako zose nozijale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">nozikumbuke du saviya mazi ya mabohwelo yajinkile.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Wikazi wako naung'ale kujinka zuwa dya msi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">chiza nacho nachihitukile kutenda ulangazi kukakucha.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Notende mkankalu kwaviya hana msuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">nodimwe na kwikala mpeho tondolo.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Nogone naho hahana mntu akudaha kukogofya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">wantu walozize nawakulombeze wambizi.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Mna meso ya wantu wavu hayawone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">awo hawatende na sila ya kusumkila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">Msuhi wawo wo udumo ni file du.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s">Hitulo dya Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu ahitula akagamba,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />nyuwe mwi wantu wata umanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">Umo mkeza kubanika, umanyi nawo naho ukudumila.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Mna miye nina fanyanyi saviya nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">hata miye nna fanyanyanyi sanyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">chila mntu kamanya ivyo mlongile.<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Miye ni mntu ywa kusekwa ni wambuya zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">waniseka, hata hegu ni mchumi sina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">mna kuna chipindi simlombeza Chohile niyo akanihitula amalombezo yangu.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Wantu wakatenda watondowala watenda no ubezi kwa wadya wata nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">uge kugamba nuwo uwagila wawo wadya wata nkunto.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Wikazi wa wapolaganyi wewona wana utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">wadya wakumwihiza Chohile wewona wekala mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">wegemela izinguvu zawo kugamba nuyo mnungu ywawo.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Mna wauzeni wanyama, awo nawawahinyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">hegu wadege wo ulanga awo nawawagambileni,<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />hegu ulonge ne isi nayo naikuhinye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">hegu ulonge na samaki za kwebahali nazo nazikugambile.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Ni yuhi mgati mwe vyumbe ivyo hemanyize kugamba Chohile nuyo adamanye ayo.<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Ujima wa chila chumbe wimwe imikono yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">nuyo akuwenka wantu muye vileke watende no ujima.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Mna ni saviya lulimi lukubweda kuluma nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">magutwi nayo yabweda kwetegeleza milosi.<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Wadalahala wana ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">umanyi wikigwa kwa wakale.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Umanyi na nguvu ni vya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">ulangilizi na ubala ni vyakwe.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Chiya akuchibalanga hahana akudaha kukizenga vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">ni yuhi akudaha kumlekeila yudya ajeligwe mwe chifungo ni Chohile?<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Anachinda ifula, chapata unyazi we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">akailekeila ifula chapata mabohwelo.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Chohile ana nguvu naho mazuwa yose ni mhuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">naho wakudanta na wakudantwa ni wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Ahosa wantu wamanyi watende wahezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">na kuwatenda vilongozi watende saviya wahezi.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Awausiza maseuta ulongozi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">na kuwavisa suche za chitumwa,<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />awatenda walavyantambiko wanyanyahale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">na kuwagwisa wantu wata nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Awahoka udahi wa kulonga walangilizi wakutunywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">na kuwausiza wadalahala umanyi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Awajela soni wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">na kuwausiza nguvu vilongozi.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Alavyanya mbuli zifisigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">na kuzika mo ulumpe.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Awenka wantu udahi watende waloza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">mna akaheza awatimulaganya.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Awausiza fanyanyi vilongozi we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">na kuwegala wakangadike kwenyika hekwine sila.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Awo wapampasa pampasa kwe chiza hekwina ung'azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">na kuwatenda wasebeduke uge wakozi.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Kaula ayo yose siyawona kwa meso yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">Magutwi yangu yeva na kukombaganya.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Ayo mmanyize nyuwe miye nami siyamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">Miye suyo mhezi saivyo mwili.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Mna nahabesa kulonga na Chohile mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">na kulafya mbuli yangu na Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Mna nyuwe mwi walulimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">mwikala saviya wagangana hewe kuhonya.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Hegu mwenyamaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">wantu nawakamanya kugamba mwi wabala!<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Haluse tegelezani ivyo hufanyanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">tegelelezani ivyo hwegombela.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Nimbwani mwamlongela Chohile udanti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">Vino mwafanyanya kugamba lulimi nalumuwagile Chohile?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Togolani, mwajeza kumhingiza Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Namwite mkamhige Chohile kwechitala?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Togolani, navitenda vyedi Chohile akawazuzani nyuwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Togola namdaha kumdanta saviya mwadahile kuwadanta wantu watuhu? <verse eid="JOB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Chindedi nawakwahileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">uneva mkawahingiziza wantu chinyele,<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />ukulu wakwe haukuwatisani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">naho inkama yakwe hamkuyogoha?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Milosi yenyu ni ya bule saviya maivu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">amahigano yenyu yahwa uge chiwambaza cha ulongo. <verse eid="JOB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Nyamalani chani nilonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">ivyo navilaile nivyo.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Miye semalanya kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">icho nachilaile nicho.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Hata hegu nanikome, nichei namwikiya msuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">chindedi nanizigombele izisila zangu kulongozi kwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Chindedi dino nadinihitukile kutenda ukombolwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">kwaviya hahana mntu mwihi akudaha kumsogeila Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Tegelezesani imilosi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">magutwi yenyu yevise vino hulonga.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Semalanya kale ulahi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">kwaviya simanya kugamba miye sichuma.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Ni yuhi akunga ahige idilaho dyangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Uneva eyeho nanyamala nibanike.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Hoi Chohile ywangu ninka du mbuli mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">nami sanefise hale na weye,<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />usa umkono wako ukunikantila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">naho usekunikoma kwa kunitisa kwako.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Unuze nami nahuhitule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">Hegu sivyo goja miye nikonge kuza unihitule.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Ni masa mengahi na wavu nidamanye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">Nilagisa ubanasi wangu na amasa yangu?<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Ni mbwani ukwefisa nise kukuwona?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">Ni mbwani ukunitenda saviya mnkondo ywako?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Togola, noditise zani dinyaile dikufiliswa ni mpeho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">Miye sicho chintu mna ni saviya makanka yakufiliswa?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Kwaviya wawandika mbuli zisungu mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">na kunitenda nilisi amasa yo ubwanga wangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Kunitaliza na minyolo imwe iviga vyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">wakaula chila nkacho hujenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">nakwika udumo wa chila lwayo lujatile.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Ivyo mntu abanika saviya chintu chiwoile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">uge suche idigwe ni kuhu.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Mntu elekwe ni mvyele mazuwa yakwe ni majeche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">naho yamema nkunto.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Amwagula saviya luwa, dikaheza dyanyuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">nisaviya chizuli chikujinka nakwagila.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />We Chohile ni mbwani wetumbwadisa kumsinya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">Togola nonigale kulongozi kwako kwe nkanto?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Ni yuhi akudaha kulavya chintu chedi kulawa mwe chintu chizavu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Hahana akudaha.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Wikazi wa mntu uwazwa kwa myezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">na kwikiwa udumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">naho hakudaha kweongezeza.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Leka kumkaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">kubula achintize amazuwa yakwe saviya mntu ahakilwe.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Kuna msuhi kwa mti ukantigwe kwaviya wadaha kusuka vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">naho amasukuzi yakwe hayaleke kusuka.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Hata hegu amaizi yakwe yadaha kunyaila mo ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">ne idisina dyakwe kuwoila mwe sanga,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />mna unapata mazi majeche wasuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">na kulavya matambi saviya sukuzi.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Mna mntu anabanika nuwo udumo wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">Akaheza kufunda umuye wakwe wo udumo asigailwa ni chibwani naho?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Saviya mazi yakusika mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">na mto ukuleka kugulusa mazi, <verse eid="JOB 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />nivyo mntu akubanika hakudaha kwinuka vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">kubula aho izimbingu nazuswe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">wantu hawenuke hegu kwinulwa kulawa mwe izintongo.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />Nabesa wanifisize kwe bome hedina uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">vyatendile ivyo kubula amaya yako yasele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">ichipindi unikiye chikaheza wanikumbuka.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Uneva mntu anabanika adaha kutenda mjima vituhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">Vyendile ivyo miye nasigoja ichipindi changu cha amasulumizo chijinke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">kubula nitendwe uhya.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Aho nonitange nami nahwitikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">umo weye naunge kuniwona miye chumbe chako unumbile mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Aho nodahe kuwaza izinkacho zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">mna hokaule amasa yangu.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Walekeile uwavu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">na kufisa hale amasa yangu.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Mna nisaviya lugulu lukubogozoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">na saviya luwe lukuswa ahantu hakwe.<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />Saviya mazi yakumugusula mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">na mabohwelo ya mazi yakubuluza ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">nivyo weye ukubalanga msuhi wa wantu.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Weye wamgwisa mntu naye ausika ulo na ulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">wahitwila uso wakwe na kumdula hale.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Wanawe wakatunywa, uyo havimanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">hegu wakabelwa haviwone.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Eva ulumi wo mwili wakwe uwodu, nakwelombolezeza mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi alonga kaidi na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Vikaheza Elifazi mntu ywa Temani niyo amhitula Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />Togola, mntu mta ubala ahitula kwa milosi ya chihezi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">Togola mntu uyo kamema milosi ibule!<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Togola, mta umanyi ekanila kwa milosi heikuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">hegu kwechinda mwe milosi heina luso.<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Mna weye wabela kumvikila Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">na kuchinda mviko kulongozi kwa Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Wihi wako nuwo ukuhinya ulonge ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">weye nawe kusagula kulonga udanti.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Milosi yako yakukantila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">ulongi wako waukula chila icho nolonge.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />Togola, wafanyanya ni weye ywa nkongo kwelekwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">Weye nawikuhi umo Chohile akaumba amagulu?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Togola, weye wetegelezaga ichinyele cha Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">Togola, weye ni weye du mta ubala?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Weye kumanya chintu chani suwe hechichimanyize?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">Wakombaganya chibwani suwe hachikuchikombaganya? <verse eid="JOB 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Mgati mwetu mna wadalahala wata ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">wata mihilimo ilozize kujinka Tati yako.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Togola, ulangilizi wa Chohile nimbwani ukuulemela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">Hegu ulosi wakwe uhoile kwako sicho chintu?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Mna umoyo wako wakutintisa na kukutenda wihiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">na kufantula meso kwa maya.<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Hata wamhituka Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">na kulonga milosi ihiye saiyo.<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Mntu ni chibwani chikudaha kumtenda mkuka kwa Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">Mntu yoyose elekwe ni mvyele adaha kutenda ywedi kwa Chohile?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Uneva Chohile hakuwazumila hata wakuka wakwe wa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">hata izimbingu hazikukile kulongozi kwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />Sembuse mntu akujela chinyala na mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">mntu akudamanya wavu saviya mtu akunywa mazi.<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Haluse nitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">miye nahulagise yadya niwone,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />ayo wantu wata ubala wayalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">hewefisize chochose wahokele kulawa kwa watati zawo,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />wadya Chohile awenkile isi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">naho hahana mjeni ajinkile mgati mwawo.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Mntu mwavu atenda na usungu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">iviya mihilimo yose wekiwe wantu manyakwili.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Maizwi yakutisa nayamtwile lwasu mwa amagutwi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">hadya akufanyanya katondowala wapolaganyi wamwebunga.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Mntu mwavu hana msuhi wa kulawa mwe ichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">udumo wakwe ni kubanika kwa bamba.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Angadika akalonda nkande akagamba ikuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">Kamanya kugamba udumo wakwe wimwe chiza,<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />nkunto na masulumizo makulu ya kogofya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">zamsogeila saviya wagomba nkondo wa seuta wemalanye kwebungana.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Kwaviya eduvya kugamba adaha kumhiga Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">na kumwekambila Chohile mta nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />Kaguluka kwa wefenyi akamwebunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">akatenda na nchinga nkulu heikuvunika.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />Kwaviya uso wakwe unenehezwa ni mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">ichigudi chakwe chose chimema mavuta.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Mna wikazi wakwe mhya nautende ni mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">mwe nyumba hezikwikalwa ni wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">zikale saviya makandaluwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Mntu uyo hatende mgoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">naho ugoli wakwe hautende na loso mwe isi,<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Chiza cha file hachenege.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">Myale ya moto nainyaze isuko yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">maluwa yakwe nayafiliswe ni mpeho.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Ni vyedi aleke kwika msuhi mwe mbuli za wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">kwaviya wavu nautende nayo amaliho yawo.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Nalihwe vichintile henati kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">na welekwa wakwe hawekalise.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Natende saviya mzabibu ukuhulusa zabibu mbisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">saviya mzaituni ukuhugutika amaluwa yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Kwaviya wose hewe kumvikila Chohile haweleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">moto nautikimye amahema ya wadya wakuhokela vumbaso.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Awo wamalanya myalo ihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">myoyo yawo imema udanti.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amhitula Elifazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />Nevaga mbuli zilozize sazino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">kunihoza kwenyu kwanijela nkunto.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Togolani, vino nyuwe imilosi yenyu haina udumo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">Mna chibwani chikuleka mjendeleze kuhigana?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Iviya miye nahadaha kulonga seivyo nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">hegu mwatendile mwasulumila savino husulumila miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">nahadaha kusingisa umtwi wangu kwa kuweisani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">na mbuli zikuwagila.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Nahadaha kuwajelani moyo kwa milosi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">ne imilosi yangu ikuhoza, naiwahozani.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Mna halonga ulumi wangu hausele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">Naho hata hanyamala ulumi hausike.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Chindedi Chohile kanisakaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">kabalangisa awantu wose mwe ikaya yangu.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Kunigwila, ivyo vitenda ukuzi mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">na wantu wafanyanya kugamba sidamanya mbuli zihiye.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Mwa amaya yakwe Chohile kanihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">na kanilagisa maya yakwe yatendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">kwaviya katenda uge mnkondo ywangu akunisinyisa.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Wantu wanitila na kuniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">wanitoa mwe izifunda zangu kwa ubezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">na kulungana hamwenga kwachausa cha kunebunga.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Chohile kanitenda nigwilwe ni wantu manyakwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">na kunasa mwe mikono ya wantu wehiye.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Nahekala mwe utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">mna Chohile kaninyinya mwe isingo na kunikunta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">Chohile kanitenda tailo dye imisale yakwe,<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />wanikuntila misale kulawa ntendele zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">katula izifigo zangu hena mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">isungwi yangu kulawa mwe dini aitila hasi.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Kajendeleza kunilumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">kanebunga saviya mkankalu ywa nkondo.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Sesumila suche za majuniya kwa kulomboleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">na kwikala hasi he malumbi kwa kuhudwa.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Uso wangu udumila unkundu guu kwa kwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">nkumbitu zangu zingilwa ni ziza kulu,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />hata hegu sibalange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">na malombezo yangu kwa Chohile yachuma.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Weye isi, usekugubika wihi nidamanyizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">indilo yangu izagale chila hantu!<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Hata vino haluse mukuzi ywangu ekwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">mta kunilahila ekulanga.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Wambuya zangu wanibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">miye namwilila Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Vyawagile mntu anilombezeze kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">saviya mntu akweila kwachausa cha mbuyaye.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Heye sisigaza mihilimo mijeche du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">miye nanite uko sanuye.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Umoyo wangu ufa chevu, amazuwa yangu yasila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">imbila yajika isimbwa kale.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Chindedi watiliizi wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">utilizi wawo nauwona pwilili.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Weye Chohile, nambiza nimwechifungo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">Kwaviya hahana mntu mtuhu ywa kunambiza.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Kunyinya izifanyanyi za awambuya wangu zisekupata na umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">elo, usekuwaleka wanihude.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Mntu akuwahituka wambuyaze chani alihwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">wanawe nawafe ameso.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Chohile kanihitusa chilozo mwa awantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">sitenda mntu ywa kutwelwa mate.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Meso yangu yakomela chiza kwa usungu wa kwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">vitago vyangu vyose vitenda saviya chizuli.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Wantu wakanuni wehelwa wakawona ichilozo chino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">hadya wakuwona yadya yakunilaila miye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">wadya hewene lema wemukwa ni maya mwa wano hewekumogoha Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Hata ivyo mntu mkanuni natoze isila yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">mntu akudamanya yedi najendeleze kutenda na nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Mna nyuwe wose soni mjeze vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">mwenyu sanimpate mta ubala hata yumwenga.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Mazuwa yangu yajinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">mizungu yangu ibanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">seivyo lunda mo umoyo wangu lusika.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Wambuya zangu wahitusa chilo chitende msi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">hawakukombaganya chiza na ulangazi.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Inyumba hwikiya msuhi ni idibome hedine uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">kudya nanigone hasi mwe chiza.<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />Uneva nnaugamba ubanasi weye wi tate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">na kuugamba mnyololo weye wi mame hegu lumbu dyangu,<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />msuhi wangu wikuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">Ni yuhi akunga auwone uwo msuhi wangu?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Togola, nanisele hasi na msuhi wangu kubula kwe inchili ye ifile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">Togola, nachisele hamwenga kwa amalumbi?<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Hitulo tuhu dya Bilidadi kwa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Vikaheza Bilidadi mntu ywa Shuhi, niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />Togola ni ini nobule udumo we imilosi ino? Utende mta ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">naho nachidahe kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Nimbwani suwe chafanyanywa enga wanyama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">nawe wachiwona uge chiwahezi mwako?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Weye kwesenga mwenye vihande hande mwa amaya yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">Togola isi ilekwe ibule kwachausa chako weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">Hegu nyuwe zuswe hadya zili?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />Ulangazi wa wantu wehiye naukomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">na umwale wo umoto wakwe hawake vituhu.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Ulangazi mwe idihema dyakwe utenda chiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">ita ikumlangaziza ifa.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Nkacho za mntu mwavu zihunguzwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">uwihi wakwe naumgwise mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Iviga vyakwe vimsindika kwe lwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">uyo angadika mwe malanga yo lwavu,<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Tasi nadimgwize mwe chisigino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">lufyusa nalumnyinye vitendese.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Kafisizwa tasi mwe isanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">lufyusa lwikwa mwe isila yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Kutiswa kumjela nkama chila ntendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">na wankondo wakwe wamchisa mwe chila nkacho.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Nkomano imwonela nkwina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">file yemalanya umo akagwa.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Nyonje dihise dizagala mwe inkanda yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">manyonje yakwigala file yadya ivitago vyakwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Nauswe mwe idihema dyakwe aikiye msuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">na kwigalwa kwa seuta ywa kutisa.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Moto nawoke chila chintu mwe idihema dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">moto wa chola nawake na kuzagala chila hantu.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Uyo ni saviya mti unyaile amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">amatambi yakwe nayanyuluke.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Mweisi hahana mntu namkumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">idizina dyakwe haditajwe vituhu mwe isi.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Kauswa mo ulangazi na kudulwa kwe ichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">kabalazwa hale kulawa mwe isi.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Hana mwana hegu mwelekwa mwa awantu we ikaya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">hegu achupuluke ahantu akwikala.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Wantu wakwikala uswelo wa zuwa wehelwa ni izimbuli zimpatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">wakwikala ulailo wa zuwa wengilwa ni nkama.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Ayo nayo yakuwabwila hewemmanyize Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">nivyo heli ahantu hakwe mntu hemmanyize Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amhitula vituhu Belidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />Togola, Namjendeleze kunisulumiza kubula ini? Mkanihonda honda kwa milosi yenyu?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Nkanana zose mlongo mwanihuluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">hamkuwona soni mweivyo mkunitendela yehiye.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Hata hegu sibalanga chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">wihi wangu wanilanga miye mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Mwafanyanya kugamba mwi wedi kujinka miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">na kujeseza ujijimizi wangu niwonwe kugamba nna lema.<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Manyani kugamba Chohile kanidamanya yehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">kanigwiza mo ulwavu lwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Hata hegu naila sidamanyizwa yehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">mna hahana akuniva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">hata halombeza wambizi, sikupata uwagila wangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Chohile kafinga isila yangu kwa chiwambaza chani nisekujinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">sila zangu kazijela chiza.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Kanivula ugoli wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">na kanusiza intunyo yangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Kanibalangila ntendele zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">Msuhi wangu kausa saviya mti ung'oligwe.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Naho amaya yakwe Chohile yemukila mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">na kunitenda saviya ni mnkondo ywakwe.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Wagomba nkondo wakwe weza wanebunge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">wadamanya sila ya kwiza kwangu nakuzunguluka idihema dyangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />Chohile kawasenta awalukolo wangu hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">wambuya zangu hawakununga naho.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Wantu we ikaya yangu hawakununga naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">wambuya zangu wanijala.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Wajeni mnyumba mwangu wanijala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">wandima wangu wa chiche waniwona ni mjeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">mwawo sitenda mntu hewemmanyize.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Namwitanga mndima ywangu mna hakunitika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">hata hegu hamlombeza wambizi hakunihitula.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Mkazangu agamba muye wangu wanunka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">hata walukolo wangu hawakunga kunisogeila.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Hata wana wadodo wanibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">wakaniwona wanizoma.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Wambuya zangu wa hajihi wanihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">wadya huungisa wanihituka.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Umwili wangu usigala mavuha ne inkanda du, sihonela hadodo kubanika.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Niwonelani mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">nyuwe wambuya zangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">Kwaviya Chohile kanihosa nisulumizwe.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Ni mbwani mwantimila saviya akudamanya Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Ni mbwani hamkuchintizwa nu mwili wangu?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />Navitenda vyedi hegu imilosi yangu yawandikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">yasongolwe mwe luwe chani yekalise!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Kugamba yasongolwe kwa kalamu ya mkaa hegu chimpandwa cha chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">hegu kuyasongola mlanga mwe luwe yekale kale na kale.<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Mna simanya kugamba mkombola ywangu emeso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">mo udumo naninke uwagila wangu hano heisi.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Hata inkanda yangu inaheza kubalangwa seivyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">mna hatenda no umwili wangu uno nanimwone Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Miye mwenye nanidugane naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">miye mwenye suyo mtuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">Miye mwenye nanimwone kwa meso yangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Wambuya zangu msekufanyanya sila zikunihosa nijendeleze kusulumizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">mwagamba masulumizo yano sehosa mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Nyuwe weye mwaungwa mwogohe inkanto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">kwaviya maya yaleta nkanto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">nyuwe mmanye kugamba Chohile ichedu nuyo mlamuzi.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s">Zofali ahitula vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Vikaheza Sofali mntu ywa Namati niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />Fanyanyi zikunizaganya zanisindika nihitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">kwaviya sikudaha kwechinda vituhu.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Imilosi yako ukulonga ni mahuluto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">nivyo vikuleka na besa huhitule.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />Chindedi kuvimanya kugamba kukongela aho nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">ivyo mntu aikigwe mwe isi,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />mntu mwihi newone kugamba nimhuda kwa chipindi du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">mbwedo wa wadya hewekumvikila Chohile ni wa chipindi chijihi du.<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Mntu adaha kweduvya kugamba ni mkulu kujinka wantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">na kweduvya kwe izintunyo akwinkwa,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />mna nadulwe hale saviya amavi yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">Wadya wammanyize naweuzane, ekuhi.<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Nage saviya sozi asekuonekana vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">naho nisaviya uwoni wa nechilo.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Mntu amwone hamwone vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">ahantu hakwe hahamanyike vituhu,<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Wanawe nawalihe vyose tati yawo abunyanye wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">naye mwenye navuze ugoli wose abunyanye mwa awantu.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Hata hegu nakemanya kugamba ana nguvu zo umbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">mna zose nazigone hamwenga naye mwe sanga.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Mntu mwavu abweda vintu vya wavu akudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">saviya akubweda kudya nkande imwile,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />hata hegu hakunga kuuleka wite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">mna awikisa mo mlomo wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />Mna mwe inda yakwe nkande neitende isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">isungu saviya usungu wa nyoka.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Mntu mwavu natahike ugoli ameile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Chohile naulavye mwe inda yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Ugoli akubunyanya mntu mwavu ni saviya mntu akufyosa usungu wa mazoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">nauwakome saviya mntu alumigwe nyoka ina usungu utendese.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Hekale na kuwona kuchumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">naho hawone ujimbiko na ugoli.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Ivintu etumbwazikile navileke havidye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">ugoli wakwe haubwede,<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />kwaviya nakawabunyanya wachiwa na kuwasa hewena chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">na kuwahoka chinguvu nyumba hezizengile.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Mazuwa yose aungisa kutenda na vintu vilozize kwachausa chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">aguha chochose akunga atende nacho.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Mna hegu hahana chintu chisigale cha kuguha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">kuchumilwa kwakwe kwabula udumo.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Umo akatenda kachumilwa vitendese nagwelwe ni nkunto zitendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">Nasunguze kubwilwa ni mabuli yehise.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Umo wantu wavu wakadya ivyo wakunga waleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">mna Chohile nawakantile kwa amaya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">namwebunge kwa nkanto.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Hata hegu akenega bamba dya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">natungwe ni msale udamanywe kwa shaba.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Msale naung'olwe kulawa mo mgongo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">imbulo yakwe nailavigwe ikatenda ina sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">naho natiswe vitendese.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Mpamba ekiye nazibalagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">moto hewikuvilwa naumtikimye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">na kutikimya visigale mnyumba mwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Izimbingu nazigubule pwilili uwavu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">wantu we isi naimwihiwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Ugoli wakwe naupempulwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">mwe idizuwa dya amaya ya Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Idyo nidyo idiliho nalihwe mntu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">nicho chikigwe ni Chohile kwachausa chawo.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu ahitula vituhu Zofali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />Tegelezesani imilosi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">iyo itende nuko ukuhozwa kwangu.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Nijijimizani umo halonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">naho hajika ukulonga jendelezani kunitila.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Mafuzumo yangu hayakumlanga mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">elo, ni mbwani ninyamale.<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Nikaulani, vikaheza mwehelwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">mkaheza mnyamale dwii.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Hafanyanya ayo yanibwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">nengilwa ni chinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">naho umwili wengilwa ni nene kwa nkama.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Nimbwani Chohile akuleka wantu wavu wekale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">ni mbwani izinguvu zawo zajendeleza kubula wadalahala?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Wawona wana wawo wakachumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">na kuwawona welekwa wakakula.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Kwawo chila chintu ni chedi hehana nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">naho hawakukantilwa ni Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Majeku yawo yatongela hayakuhwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">ne izing'ombe zawo zeleka hehena lema dyodyose.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Wana wawo wawalavya kuse saviya fyo dya ngoto na mbuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">wadigilika kwa mbwedo,<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />wavina ngoma kuno wakachema na kutowa mazeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">wakabweda maizwi ya miluli.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Wantu wavu wekala wikazi wa kuchumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">hawakupata nkunto kubula mwe idizuwa dyo kubanika.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Mna wamgamba Chohile chelekele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">hachikunga kumanya ivyo weye ukunga.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Chohile ni yuhi vileke chimsankanile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">chikamlombeza chapata chibwani.<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Wafanyanya kugamba wachumilwa kwa nguvu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">mna miye sikuzumilana ne izifanyanyi zawo izo.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />Ni nkanana nyingahi uwone wantu wavu wasunguza kubanika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Kuna mntu agwelwe ni nkondo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Hegu Chohile ajezaga kuwakoma wantu wavu kwa maya yakwe?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Vileke watende saviya mani yanyaile yakufiliswa ni mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">hegu watende saviya makanka yakufiliswa ni nkung'unto?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Mwagamba, Chohile aika mpamba nkanto ya mntu kwachausa cha wanawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Chohile amlihe mntu mwenye chani wavimanye kugamba wakola masa.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Walekeni wavu wawone wenye wakakomwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">wawone wenye ukulu wa Chohile mta nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Kwaviya wantu wavu wanabanika wana mbwedo wani na awelekwa wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">umo amazuwa yawo yanabula udumo?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Togola, hana mntu adaha kumhinya ubala Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">kwaviya uyo mwenye nuyo akukantila hata wose we mlanga mwa wose.<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Wantu wasiku wabanika wakatenda wachumilwa vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">wakatenda wenenwa naho wata nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />Imili yawo ikatenda idamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">mavuha yawo yamema misopwa mndani mwawo.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Watuhu wekala na chinyulu mwe imyoyo ujima wawo wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">hewawone hata dyedi dimwenga diwalaile.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Mna wose wabanika na kuhambwa mwe lumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">naho wose wagubikwa ni ntende.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Ivyo mkufanyanya vyose miye sivimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">ne imizungu yenyu ihiye mkunga mnidamanyize.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Naho mwagamba, “Inyumba ya uyo mkulu ikuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">Izinyumba wekalaga wantu wavu zikuhi?”<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Wajinka sila hamuwauzize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">na kwivana nawo mwe izimbuli wakulonga?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Kugamba mntu mwavu alekeilwa mwe zuwa dya file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">akombolwa mwe zuwa dya maya.<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Ni yuhi akunga amlahe mntu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">hegu akunga amlihe kwa yose adamanye.<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Umo akegalwa kwe imbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">imbila yakwe yaikwa wamizi waidime, <verse eid="JOB 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />wantu walozese nawamtongele mnyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">na lukudidi lwa wantu lumlongoila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">Umo akahambwa ulongo waselezwa mlanga mwakwe mpalahole.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Elo, nyuwe namdahe kunihoza kwa milosi yenyu ya chihezi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">Hahana chisigale cho kunihitula ukaleka udanti uwodu!<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi ahitula katatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Vikaheza Elifazi mntu ywa Temani niyo amhitula Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />Togola, mntu adaha kumwambiza Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">mntu mta ubala adaha kumwambiza Chohile?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Togola, Chohile nakapata chibwani hegu watendile mkanuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">Hegu uyo nakapata loso lwani hegu izisila zako zendile zichuma?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Wafanyanya akukwahila na kukukantila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">kwaviya wamtunya?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Bule, ni kwaviya kudamanyisa masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">wihi wako hauna udumo.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Weye kumhoka mlukolo ywako suche ya ukombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">kumguhila isuche iyo imwenga du endile nayo na kumwasa mwazi.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Huwenkile mazi ya kunywa wadya wendile wasokele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">huwenkile nkande wadya wendaga na sala.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Hata hegu wendaga mntu mta udahi ukalongoza isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">mntu akutunywa ukekala mwe isi.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Kuleka kuwambiza wavyele wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">kuwadamanyiza yehiye wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Kwaviya una nkunto zilozese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">nivyo vikuleka kwingilwa ni nkama.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Kugwelwa ni chiza hukudaha kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">kugubikwa ni nkulujumbu ya mazi.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Chimanya kugamba Chohile eyuko kulanga kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Kulanga kujinka izintondo zikulanga vitendese!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Mna weye wagamba, “Chohile kamanya mbwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Togola adaha kulavya nkanto mwe chiza?”<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Wafanyanya kugamba maingu yazamile ni ngubiko yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">ivyo hakuchiwona umo akajenda mo ulanga we isi.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Waunga utimile sila za chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">izo watimilaga wantu wavu?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Awo wabanikaga chipindi chawo hechinati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">vyegamo vyawo vyazolagwa ni nkulujumbu ya mazi.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Awo wamgambaga Chohile, chileke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">Uyo Chohile mta nguvu adaha kuchidamanyiza chibwani.<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Mna Chohile nuyo amemeze izinyumba zawo vintu vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">ivyo, nawenega wantu wavu ne imizungu yawo.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Wantu wata uwagila wawona na kwelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">hewena lema wawaseka na kuwabela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">umo wantu wavu wakakantilwa,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />wagamba chindedi wankondo wetu wakomwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">chiya wasigaze chitikimya moto.<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />Mmanyise Chohile chani utende na utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">vileke mbuli ntana zikwizile.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Hokela amahinyo akukuhinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">na kwika imilosi yakwe mo umoyo wako.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Unamuwiya Chohile novuzwe uhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">uneva unausa wavu utende hale ne inyumba yako,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />Izahabu yako wongwa uiwone isaviya malumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">na zahabu yako ntana vitendese isaviya luwe mwa amakolongo,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />Mleke Chohile mta nguvu atende niyo izahabu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">naho atende nuyo mayuwe yako ya chumbu.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Aho nowebwedeze kwa Chohile mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">weye nawike lunda lwako kwa Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Nomlombeze naye nakwive,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">weye nochintize izinazili zako wikiye kwa Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Nochumilwe mwe yose nodamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">ulangazi naulangaze mwe izisila zako.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Umo wantu wanaselezwa weye nogambe, wenule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">Chohile naye namwambule afile chevu.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Uyo nawambule hata yudya mta lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">nambulwe kwachausa cha wedi we imikono yako.<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu ahitula vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />Hata dyelo amafuzumo yangu ni usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">nengilwa ni ulumi na kuugula.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Hegu namanyize ahantu nanimwone Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">nahaita hajihi naye.<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Nasigala idilaho dyangu kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">na kumgambila ulosi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Nahaunga nimanye ivyo akunga anihitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">na kukombaganya icho akunga anigambile.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Togola, Chohile adaha kuhigana na miye kwe izinguvu zakwe zose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Bule, nakanitegeleza viya nilongile.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Chohile adaha kulonga na mntu mkanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">miye nasiwoneka sina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">na kulekeilwa ni Chohile mlamuzi ywangu mazuwa yose.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Kaula naita ntendele yo ulailo wa zuwa mna hakuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">nahituka ntendele yo uswelo wa zuwa mna simwone.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Umo akadamanya ndima ntendele ya chenya sikumwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">nahituka ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi iviya sikumuwona.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Mna Chohile kamanya izisila zangu hujenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">anaheza kunijeza, nanilawe uge zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Natimila nkacho zakwe kwa ukanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">sitoza isila yakwe sanijeze kuhituka.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Sijezize kuleka imiko yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">milosi yakwe siika mo umoyo wangu kujinka nkande hudya chila zuwa.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Uyo hakuhitukila, naho hahana akudaha kumhiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">hegu kumchinda mwe ivyo akunga adamanye.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Nachintize viya vikumuwagila mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">naho achei ana myalo ilozize,<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />ivyo, nazingiza kwa nkama kulongozi kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">chila hafanyanya du nengilwa ni woga.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Chohile mta nguvu, kautenda umoyo wangu ufe chififimbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">naho kanijela nkama.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Sanileke kulonga kwachausa cha chiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">hegu ziza dikugubika uso wangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />Ni mbwani Chohile asekwika chipindi cha kukantila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">Ni mbwani wadya wammanyize walonda amazuwa ayo hawakuyawona?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Wantu wasamiza mayuwe ya mihaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">wadima mafyo ya ludimo watile kuhoka.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Wahoka mpunda za wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">waguha ukombo ng'ombe za wavyele wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Wawachinda wachiwa wasekuhokela viya vikuwawagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">na kuwatenda wachiwa wose mwe isi wefise.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Ivyo, wachiwa wekala saviya mpunda miliya kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">walonda nkande mudya mnyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">kwaviya hahana hantu wakudaha kuwalondela nkande awana wawo.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Vyaleka wachiwa wasokoza mwe nkonde sizo zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">wasokoza mwe nkonde za zabibu za wantu wavu.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Chilo chijima wagona mwazi hewena suche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">hawana cha kwegubika chipindi cha mpeho.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Wachabala kwa fula ikunya kolugulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">wefisa mwe mpanga zimo luwe wasekuchabala.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Mwana hena welesi apolaganywa mwa amatombo, mwana mteke ywa mchiwa apempulwa kwachausa cha ukombo.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Kwaviya waswesa suche wajenda mwazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">wenula machisa ya ngano kuno wana sala. <verse eid="JOB 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Wachiwa waminya mazaituni wakadamanya mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">naho wafumbula zabibu wakadamanya divai kuno wakatenda wana nchilu.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Ndilo yo usungu ya wadya wakubanika yevika kulawa komzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">wadya walumizwe waguta kwa izwi walombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">mna Chohile hakwetegeleza amalombezo yawo.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />Weyaho wantu wavu hewekunga ulangazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">hewemanyize sila yo ulangazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">naho hawakunga kutimila izisila zakwe.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Mkomi enuka chilochilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">chani akawakome wachiwa na wasokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">chilo chikabula ndima yakwe nu ubavi.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Mjenda uyaga naye agoja chiza chingile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">akafanyanya kugamba hahana akuniwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">akaheza afisa uso wakwe na suche.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Nechilo wabavi watula nyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">mna nomsi wevugaila mnyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">hawakunga kudamanya chochose mo ulanga.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Ziza kwawo wose nuwo ulangazi wa mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">wetenda wambuya wa vikutisa nechilo.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa udumo wa Zofala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />“Wantu wavu ni saviya chifulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">wasunguza kukubwa ni mazi, ahantu hawo mlanga mwe sanga haligitwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">elo, hahana hata yumwenga akwita kwe nkonde ye imizabibu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Ni saviya balafu ikulujuka ikabwilwa ni zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">nivyo isi ya wabanike ikuwapempula wata masa.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Mwelesi ywawo awajala awantu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">awo watenda nkande ya ntende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">wantu wavu hawakumbukwe vituhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">Mna nawafyoke saviya mti.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Wantu wavu wawabunyanya wavyele hewepatile wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">naho hawakuwadamanyiza wedi wavyele wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Mna Chohile awachinchisa wata nguvu kwa udahi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">hata hegu wachumilwa wafa chevu cho ujima.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Adaha akawaleka wantu wavu wewone wekale mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">mna ameso yakwe yasinya imijendele yawo.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Wantu wavu wachumile kwa chipindi chidodo, vikaheza wosika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">waselezwa na kusigwa mwe isila saviya watuhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">wakaheza wakantwa uge maiso ya ngano.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Elo, icho nilongile ni chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">hahana akudaha kuniwona nadanta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">na kulagisa kugamba imilosi yangu sicho chindedi?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s">Hitulo dya Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Vikaheza Bilidadi mntu ywa Shuhi, niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />Udahi na kutunywa ni vya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">uyo aika utondowazi kubula kulanga kwe imbingu.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Togola, mabunga ya wagomba nkondo wakwe yadaha kuwazwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Ni yuhi hekulangazizwa nu ulangazi wakwe?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Elo, mntu du adaha vivihi kutenda muwagila kulongozi kwa Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">Mntu du adaha vivihi kwetenda ni mtana?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Uneva hata mnenge haukulangaza vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">ne izintondo nazo hazikukile kulongozi kwa Chohile,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />sembuse mntu akwinga fuza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">Mntu yudya ni funyo du?<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s">Hitulo dya Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo ahitula,<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />Kaula ivyo umwambize mntu hekwedaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">ivyo umwambule mntu hena nguvu!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Ni ulangilizi wani umwinkile uyo hene ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">naho ni umanyi wani mkulu ulagise!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Ni yuhi akwambize ukulonga imilosi iyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">Ni yuhi akutintise ulonge saivyo?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">H Bilidadi ahitula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />Wabanike uko hasi wazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">mazi na wose wakwikala umo mndani wogoha.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />File igubuka kulongozi kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">hantu ho ubanasi hahana ngubiko ikudaha kugubika.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Chohile atantalika ulanga wa chenya hantu he bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">isi kainenemeza hantu hehena chintu.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Ayavugaila amazi mwe maingu yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">hata ivyo maingu hayakutulika ko uzami wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Agubika uso wo mnenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">autantalika ingu mlanga mwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Kaika mhaka mwe bahali ne imbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">kaika mhaka wa chilo na msi.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Izinguzo ze imbingu zazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">na kwehelwa akazikwahila.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Kaihoza ibahali kwa nguvu zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">na kwa umanyi wakwe kadikoma idizoka dya mwe bahali dikwitangwa Lahabu.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Kasunta ulanga kwa muye wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">kwa umkono wakwe kadikoma idizoka dikusumka.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Yano ni majeche du ye izintendwa zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">uwo ni mtakaliso du chikwiva kumlanga uyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Ni yuhi akudaha kumanya ukulu we izinguvu zakwe?<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amhitula Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Ayubu niyo ajendeleza kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />Nelisa kwa Chohile mta ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">anusize uwagila wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">Chohile mta nguvu anusize miye vyendile vyangu,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />nelisa kugamba mwe ichipindi chose nanitende no ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">muye wa Chohile ukatenda uchei mndani mwangu,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />milomo yangu haijeze kulonga udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">miye sanilonge mbuli za kuwadanta wantu.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Sikudaha kugamba nyuwe mwalonga chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">hata mwe idizuwa hubanikila sanigambe sina lema.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Nanitozesa uwagila wangu, naho saniuleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">mwe izamili yangu sina cha kunikantila mo wikazi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />Mnkondo ywangu enkwe nkanto saidya ya mntu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">wakunisulumiza wakantilwe saviya hewena uwagila kwa Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Hewekumtunya Chohile ana msuhi wani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">umo Chohile akawausa wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">umo Chohile akamusiza ujima wakwe?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Togola, Chohile neve indilo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">umo akabwila ni nkunto?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Mntu mwavu hakudaha kwelelwa kulongozi kwa Chohile Mta Nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">hadahe kumlombeza Chohile chipindi chose.<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Goja niwahinyeni ukulu ne izinguvu ananazo Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">saniwafiseni imizungu ya Chohile Mta Nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Mna nyuwe mbuli zino mzimanya vyedi vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">elo, ni mbwani mkulonga uhezi sauwo?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zofala ahitula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Vino nivyo Chohile mta nguvu akuwakantila wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">icho nicho apangilwe mntu mnkumbizi.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Hata hegu akatenda na wana chilume walozize nawakomelwe kwe nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">welekwa wakwe hawatende na nkande ikuchinta.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Wadya nawasigale nawabanike kwa manyonje yehise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">naho hata wavyele wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo hawalomboleze izifile zawo.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Hata akachisanya matundu enga lumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">na suche zilozize hata adunduga kuzivala,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />vintu vyose mntu mwavu akwechisanyiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">navivalwe ni mta kumuwagila Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">hena lema nuyo nenkigwe amatundu ayo. <verse eid="JOB 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Nyumba akuzenga mntu mwavu ni saviya ntando ya bwilili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">hegu saviya heha dya mwamizi kwe nkonde.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Mntu mwavu agona akatenda ni mgoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">mna akenuka abwila ugoli wose usika.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Natiswe saviya mabohwelo ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">nechilo nebungwe ni nkung'unto.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Nasebeduswe ni nkung'unto ya ulailo wa zuwa na kwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">afiliswa hale kulawa mo wikazi wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Nkung'unto iyo naiwebunge hehena mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">nawajeze kusumka mna hawadahe.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Wantu nawamtoile magasa'</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">na kumzoma ahalawe ahantu hakwe.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu atogola Ubala wa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Chindedi kuna hantu hakusimbwa mayuwe ya chumbu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">naho kuna hantu hakusuntila zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Wantu wafuka chuma mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">shaba nayo yalujulwa kulawa mwe mayuwe ya shaba.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Wafuka mayuwe ya yombe kulu waita na lumuli kwe chiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">wayalonda hata hegu ye hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">wasimba mayuwe ya yombe kulu mwe chiza.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Wantu wafuka mabome hale no wikazi wa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">hale na wantu hantu hehekubulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">wasela wakanemanema mwe sigi watalizwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Nkande yavunwa kulawa mwe sanga, mna hasi he isanga chila chintu chabalangwa kwa moto.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Mwa amayuwe yakwe numo mwili mayuwe ya yombe kulu yana langi ibuluu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">na ulongo wakwe una lumbi dya zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Hahana kadege kamanyize isila iyo yefisize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">hegu ziso dya mpungu diwone isila iyo.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Hahana wanyama wa kumbago wakujenda kwa kwefyenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">hegu simba ijinkile mwe izisila izo.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Wantu wakufuka mayuwe yatogese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">wasimba na kusamiza hadya yendile.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Watula mifilimbi mgati mwe izinyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">meso yakwe yabunkula mayuwe yana yombe kulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Walonda nkongelo ze mito wazisite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">na kuvileta kuse vintu vyefisize.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Mna ubala wapatikana kuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Ni hahi mntu akudaha kuhina umanyi?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Hahana mntu amanyize yombe dyo ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">naho ubala haukupatikana mwe isi ya wata ujima.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Mizumilizo ye ibahali yagamba ubala haumuli mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">ibahali yagamba ubala mwangu haumuli.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Ubala haukugulwa kwa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">naho yombe dyakwe hadikudaha kuhimwa kwa mayuwe ya chumbu.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Haikudaha kugulwa kwa zahabu ntana ikulawa Ofili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">hegu kugulwa kwa shohamu ya yombe kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">hegu yakuti samawi ya yombe kulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Zahabu hegu chelole havikuligana nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">naho haikudaha kuhitulizanywa na zahabu yedi.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Ubala una yombe kulu ditendese kujinka mayuwe yakwitangwa malijani hegu yasipi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">yombe dyakwe dyajinka yombe dya lulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Mayuwe ya topazi ikulawa Kushi, Isiopia haikudaha kuliganywa na umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">naho ubala haukudaha kugulwa kwa zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Elo, ubala walawa kuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Ni kuhi chikudaha kuhina umanyi?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Ubala ufiswa hale na ameso ya vyumbe vyose vina ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">wadege mo ulanga hawakudaha kuuwona.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Isi ya wabanike na file vyagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">mwamagutwi yetu chiva mvumilo uwodu.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Chohile uyodu nuyo amanyize isila yo ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">kamanya ahantu ukulawa ubala.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Kwaviya uyo awona kubula uhelo we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">naho awona chila chintu hasi he mbingu.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Umo adamanyaga nguvu mwe mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">na kwika mihaka ya amazi mwe bahali,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />umo alavyaga lagizo kugamba fula inye hahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">na lumwemwe na mbaula vijinkile kuhi,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />aho naho awonaga ubala na kuutambalisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">kaimalanya na kuizuza.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Vikaheza Chohile niyo awagamba wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">“Kumtunya Zumbe Chohile nuwo ubala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">Kwenega wavu nuwo umanyi.”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu abindiliza kwegombela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo akonga kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />Hegu wikazi wangu watendile saudya wa kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">hadya Chohile endile akanidima.<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />Nkanana zose Chohile endaga na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">ulangazi wakwe unambiza kujinka mwe chiza.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Chipindi icho nasichumilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">chipindi umbuya wa Chohile ukadima hamwenga ne inyumba yangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Chohile mta nguvu nendile achei hamwenga na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">hatenda hamwenga na wanangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Umo izing'ombe zangu ne izimbuzi zangu nazikaninka mele yalozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">mizaituni yangu ne ikakula mwe sanga ina mayuwe.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Naduganaga na wadalahala he inchili yo mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">nakwikala ahantu hangu,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />wabwanga wananiwona wekaila hankanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">wadalahala wendile wekale hasi nawakachimala kwa kunitunya.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Masekulu weze waniwone nawakaleka kutamwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">wagubika imilomo kwe imikono yawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Maizwi ya wata kutunyiswa yanyamazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">Milomo yawo niyo yanyamala.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Chila evile izimbuli zangu kanungila yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">eze aniwone kazumila kugamba mbuli izo ni chindedi.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Nahawambiza wachiwa wanilombeze wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">iviya siwambiza wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo hewena wa kuwambiza.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Wadya wendile wehaguhi na kubanika wanitogola kwaviya niwambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">sambiza wavyele wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo vyaleka watende na mbwedo vituhu.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Mazuwa yose sidamanya vikuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">ukanuni mwangu wendaga saviya nkazu na chilemba.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Nahawalongoza sila wantu matuntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">nahawambiza vintu vyawo wata kuholomala iviga.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Kwa wachiwa nendaga saviya tati yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">nahahikiliza kugombela wantu simanyize wapate uwagila wawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Nahabalanga nguvu za wantu manyakwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">na kuwakombola wadya watahigwe.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Nahafanyanya kugamba nanitende na wikazi mtali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">na kubanika mwe inyumba yangu hatenda na chinyemi.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Miye nahenga mti wikiye amaizi yakwe mwe mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">mnyuzu wa chilo wachabaza amatambi yangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Chila mntu na akanijimbika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">izinguvu zangu hazahungukaga.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Umo hawalangiliza wantu nawakanyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">nawakanetegeleza ayo hulonga,<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />wendaga hawana dyakongezeza umo habinda ukulonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">Nawakafanyanyisa imilosi nahalonga,<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />wantu nawakanigoja saviya wantu wakugoja fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">wendaga saviya walimi wakugoja fula za kuhandila.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Umo wakafa chevu nahawalagisa kumunya munya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">uso wangu na ukalagisa chinyemi mwawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Nahawalongoza wantu na kuwalagisa isila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">mwawo nendaga saviya seuta mwa awagomba nkondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">saviya mtu akuhoza wantu wakulomboleza.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Mna haluse wantu wanibela!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">Wana wadodo ukaleka miye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">Wantu awo hata watati zawo nahawakuwagila hata kusinya amakuli ya kudima izingoto zangu.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Nasipata chibwani kulawa mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">wantu wahwelese?<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Nawanyala kwa kuswesa nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">nechilo wangadika wakalonda ndiga mwesi inyaile heine chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">heikulimika hegu kwikalwa ni wantu.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Mwawasaka nawakachisanya madaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">nkande yawo yendaga maizi ya ndiga!<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Wabalazwa hale na wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">wantu wawatwila chizumo uge ni wabavi.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Viwatenda wekale mwe mpanga zinyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">na mwe mabome yasimbigwe mwe sugulu na mwe nyuwe.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Nawakaila saviya mpunda zina sala mwa masaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">na kwechisanya hamwenga hasi he chihumpu.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Wendaga ni wantu wahezi hewekutunywa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">Wabalazwa wamlawe mweisi yawo wenye.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />Haluse wana wawo wanichemela nchemo zo ubezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">wanitendela utilizi.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Wakaniwona wanihiwa na kunenega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">wakaniwona du wanitwela mate mo uso.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Kwaviya Chohile kanisokeza na kunisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">weyegewa kunitenda ivyo wakunga.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Fyo dya wantu dyanebunga nisumke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">Wanebunga vileke wanikome.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Awantu awo wafinga isila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">naho wachumilwa kunigaila nkomano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">naho hahana mntu ywa kunambiza.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Wanizila saviya wantu wakujinka mwe luwawi lwangalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">wakaheza kunebunga wanigwise hasi.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Singilwa ni nkama vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">untu wangu uswa saviya mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">undima wangu wagila saviya ingu.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />Haluse nihaguhi na kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">mazuwa ya masulumizo yangu yanibwila.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Nechilo amavuha yangu yaluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">ulumi ukuniluma haukuhola.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Kwa nguvu zakwe Chohile katenda saviya suche mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">kaninyinya mwe singo saviya suche.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Kanidula mwe ntagata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">miye sitenda saviya lumbi na maivu.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Nakwilila weye Chohile, mna hukunihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">naho hata hakulombeza, hukunitegeleza.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Kuhituka nyakwili mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">wanisulumizisa ne izinguvu zako zose.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Wanidula mwe mpeho inifilise hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">wanisunkasunka mwe nkung'unto.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Sivimanya kugamba wanigala kwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">hantu nawadugane wantu wata ujima.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Togola, mntu akatenda mwe nkunto na ubanasi hakulombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">togola akatenda mwe masulumizo hakulombeza mbazi?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Togola siwalombezeze wadya wendile mwe nkunto miye nasila nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">siwawonele usungu kwachausa wantu wachiwa?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Mna nasika msuhi wa yedi, sipata yehiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">sigoja ulangazi, mna kukomela chiza.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Umoyo wangu wangadika haukutongomala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">mazuwa ya masulumizo yanibwila.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Unyonje uhosa inkanda yangu itenda ntitu, mna haihyele na zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">Sichimala mo lumpe nalombeza wambizi.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Kwa ndilo yangu sitenda mlukolo ywa mauzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">miye na makungwi hachikusekana.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Inkanda yangu yazubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">naho amavuha yangu yahya saviya mntu akuhuma.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Elo, limba dyangu dya chinyemi dihituswa dya malombolezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">mluli wangu utenda izwi dya ndilo.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />Miye sika lagano mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">sanimsinye mndele na kummeila mate.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Chohile mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">nawakantile awantu wakudamanya ivyo.<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Uyo egala ubanasi kwa wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">na nkomano kwa wadya wakudamanya yehiye.<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Chohile kamanya chila chiya hudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">naho kamanya viya hwikala mo wikazi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Nelisa sinati nilonge lulimi hata kujeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">naho sajezaga kudanta mpwii.<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Leka Chohile anikantile viya vikuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">naye nawone kugamba sina lema.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Uneva ulujendo lwangu sulo lwedi na kuileka isila yedi hegu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">miye niyo natimila kumeila mate kwa ameso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">hegu imikono yangu ijelwa uzavu ni masa,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />elo, nkande nisumile vidigwe ni mntu mtuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">viya nihandile kwenkonde ving'olwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Uneva miye simmeila mate mkaza mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">hegu sinyatila he lwivi lwa mntu,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />aho, mkazangu ambikile mgosi mtuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">naho agone na wagosi watuhu.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Kwaviya mbuli saiyo ni masa makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">ni wavu ukumunga mlamuzi alavye nkanto.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Amasa yangu nayatenda saviya moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">wa kunitikimya na kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">na kutikimya ivintu vyangu vyose.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Hegu silemela kuwenka viya nawakaungwa wapate awandima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">wachilume hegu wa chiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">umo wendile na mafuzumo na miye.<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />Uneva sinadamanye ivyo, nanigeze kwa Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">Naho nanimgambe mbwani Chohile akeza kunikantila?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Chohile nuyo achumbile suwe chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">nuyo yumwenga achumbile chose mndani mwe izinda za wamami zetu.<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Sajezaga kulemela kuwambiza wachiwa mpwii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">hegu kuwaleka wavyele wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo waswese msuhi,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />hegu sidya nkande yangu ichedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">hehena kuwenka wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo?<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Mna, kukongela ubwanga wangu sitenda nawalela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">kukongela udodo wangu siwalongoza wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Chila hawona mntu mta sakaza elusi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">hegu mchiwa hekudaha kugula suche, <verse eid="JOB 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />nahamwinka suche zidamanywe kwa mazoya ye izingoto zangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">Vikaheza anijimbika kwa moyo wakwe wose.<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Uneva simbunyanya mwana abanikilwe ni welesi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">hamanya kugamba nanihingizwe kwe ichitala,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />uneva nivyo Chohile anikantile, umkono wangu uhasukile kwediyega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">naho uvunike kulawa he chinko.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Kwaviya nogoha inkanto ya Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">sikudaha kudamanya mbuli saizo.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Sikiye msuhi mo ugoli wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">na zahabu itende wamizi wangu,<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />hegu kwefenya kwachausa cho ugoli wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">hegu kweduvya mwe ivyo nipatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">kwa kudamanya ndima miye mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />Sivikile zuwa mo ung'azi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">hegu umnenge mo utana wakwe wose,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />umoyo wangu hauluvigwe uvikile ivintu ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">na kutunya imikono yangu kwa kuisesa.<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Uneva natendile ivyo uwo ni wavu wa kukantilwa ni walamuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">kwaviya nasitenda mdanti kulongozi kwa Chohile Mkulu.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Selelwaga hadya wankondo wangu wakakunta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">hegu kubweda umo wakapatwa ni nkomano,<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Siwalongele vihiye wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">kwa kuwaligita vileke wabanike.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Awandima wa mnyumba mwangu walonga pwilli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">chila mjeni kagonekwa mnyumba mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Hahana mjeni agonile kweise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">kwaviya siwalekile watafi wagone kuse.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Wantu awamwenga wafisa masa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">mna miye sifisize amasa yangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Kwachausa cha kogoha fyo dya wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">na ivyo kutenda na nkama ya kubelwa ni wantu mwe ikaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">niyo nanyamala dwii nisekufosa kuse ko ulwivi.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Nahabesa kwatendile na mntu ywa kunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">nelisa kugamba chila mbuli nilongile ni chindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">leka Chohile Mkulu anihitule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Nahabesa amalaho hulahwa na awankondo wangu wayawandike.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Nasiyavala mwa mayega yangu kwa kweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">na kuyaika komtwi saviya chilemba cho useuta.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Nasimgambila Chohile chila mbuli nidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">nasimbasa uge mwana seuta.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Uneva sibawa isanga hulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">hegu vyandile ni chindedi isanga yenye nainilaha,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />uneva sidya ulozo wakwe haleka kuliha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">na kuhosa file ya awenye isanga,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />elo, miwa ihote ukaleka ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">mbaya ihote ukaleka shaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">Udumo we imilosi ya Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Elihu alonga na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Elo, wambuya watatu wa Ayubu, Elifazi na Bilidadi na Sofali niyo waleka kumhitula Ayubu kwaviya endaga hana lema. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Mna Elihu mwana ywa Balakeli, kulawa mwe idikabila dya Buzi wo lukolo lwa Lama, niyo amwihiwa Ayubu. Kwaviya ketenda ni mkanuni, hagojize alongwe ni Chohile. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Iviya Elihu kawehiwa wambuya watatu wa Ayubu, kwaviya hawamhitule Ayubu mwe izinkunto zakwe, nawakaungwa wamgamba kabalanga. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Kwaviya Elihu endaga nuyo mdodo mwawo, ivyo nakenyamaila akagoja awo wadalahala wakomeleze kulonga na Ayubu. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Mna Elihu eze awone kugamba awo wantu watatu wadunduga kumhitula Ayubu, niyo emukwa ni maya, <verse eid="JOB 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Elihu niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">“Miye ni mbwanga mdodo, nyuwe mdalahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">ivyo nendile hogoha kuwagambilani icho nahafanyanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Nahelongela mo umoyo wangu, waleke wata mazuwa yalozese walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">na wadalahala wahinye ubala.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Mna iloho imndani mwe mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">muye wa Chohile Mkulu nuwo ukumdahiza mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">na kumwinka ubala.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Wata ubala sawo wadalahala awodu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">hegu wata mihilimo ilozize awodu nawo wamanyize uwagila.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Ivyo haluse naunga mnitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">gojani niwagambileni ivyo hufanyanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Nahagoja umo mkalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">nahetegeleza izinjelo zo ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">umo mkalonda milosi yo kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Siwetegelezeni vyedi vina mwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">mna hahana hata yumwenga mwenyu alavyanye kugamba Ayubu kabalanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">naho hahana hata yumwenga mwenyu adahile kuhitula imilosi yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Msekugamba mwi wabala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">Chohile nuyo du akudaha kumhitula Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">nyuwe mdunduga.<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Ayubu kawahitulani nyuwe, suyo miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">elo, sanimhituleni seivyo nyuwe mumhitule.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Wajelwa nkama naho hawana dya kongezeza kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">wasilwa ni milosi.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Togolani, nigoje du kwaviya mnyamala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">Kwaviya mwikala du hamkuhitula chintu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">Mchimala hemna dya kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Bule, miye nna dyakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">miye nanilonge viya hufanyanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Nna milosi ilozese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">Moyo wangu wanitintisa nilonge.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Uneva ninaswesa luhenyo lwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">umoyo wangu nisaviya divai igubikwe mwe mkwiji wa mkota wihajihi na kutulika.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Vyaungwa nilonge vileke nipate luhulwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">naungwa nigubule mlomo chani nihitule.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Sanimhingize mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">hegu kumhembeleza mntu yoyose.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Kwaviya miye simanyize kumhembeleza mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">nna hembeleza Chohile nasunguze kunikoma.”<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />Haluse, Ayubu, tegelezesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">yadya yose hunga nilonge.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Kaula semalanya kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">kulonga yadya yemwe zifanyanyi zangu.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Miye ni mkanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">milosi yangu yose ni chindedi.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Iloho ya Chohile inumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">na umuye wakwe Chohile waninka ujima.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Ivyo nihitula hegu ukadaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">kwemalanye unigambile izinkunto zangu.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Weye na miye chiwamwenga kulongozi kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">chose chumbwa kwa ulongo,<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />usekunogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">milosi yangu izamile mana haikuzamile.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Chindedi kulonga, miye siva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">yose ulongile siyakombaganya,<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />Weye kulonga, “Wi ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">naho huna lema.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Ivia kugamba Chohile akulondela luhosa akuwone wisaviya mnkondo ywakwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Iviga vyako avinyinya minyolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">na kuzuza izinkacho zangu zose.”<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Mna nakugambila Ayubu, aho kubalanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">Chohile ni mkulu kujinka mntu yoyose.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Nimbwani ukuhigana naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">kwani unamuza hakuhitule?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Chohile Mkulu alonga na wantu kwa sila zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">mna wantu wadaha wasekukombaganya.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Chohile alonga na wantu mwe sozi na uwoni wa chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">umo wakatolosha ntongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">wantu wakasinka mwe izisazi zawo.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Awatenda wetegeleze viya akulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">na kuwatenda wengilwe ni nkama kwa amakanyo yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Chohile alonga nawo chani waleke masa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">na kuwakombola mo kweduvya kwawo.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Ivyo amchinda mntu asekukomwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">anasekwita kwe izimbila.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Chohile aliganya wantu kwa kuwegaila unyonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">na masulumizo heyekuleka mwe imili yawo.<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />Wadya wakulumwa waswesa nkwina ya kudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">hata akadya nkande yedi aitahika.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Umwili wakwe wanyala vyaleka hakumanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">mavuha yakwe yefisize umo henati kuhuma, haluse yafoseza kuse,<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />ehaguhi na kwingila mwe imbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">ujima wakwe wihajihi, file yamgoja imguhe.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Hegu kuna mndima ywa kwembingu yumwenga entendele yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">hegu akumgombela yumwenga mwa awandima wa Chohile maelufu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">chani amlagise cho kudamanya.<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Mo kuchiwonela mbazi mndima ywa kwembingu namgambe Chohile, “Mwambule! Anase kwingila kwedibome hedina uhelo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">Nna ukombo kwachausa chakwe.”<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Aho, umwili wakwe naudahe kutenda na nkanda nteke kujinka ya mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">nguvu zo ubwanga wakwe nazimuwiye,<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Vikaheza namlombeze Chohile naye nawazumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">nawamvikile Chohile kwa chinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">Chohile nawavuzize watende wekale vyedi naho.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Naho akwiza kwa chinyemi kulongozi kwa wantu na kugamba, “Nasikola masa na kwazaganya chendile chiwagila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">Mna Chohile hanikantile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">mna sikantilwe viya vikuligana.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Chohile kanambula nisekubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">nichei mjima nawona ulangazi.”<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Chohile amtendela mntu yano yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">nkanana mbili hegu ntatu,<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />chani ahituile ujima wa mntu asekubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">awone ulangazi wo ujima.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Haluse, Ayubu, tegelezesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">nyamala hugambile.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Mna uneva una dya kulonga, nihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">kwaviya naunga huwone huna lema.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Uneva huna dyakulonga nyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">miye nahuhinye ubala.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Elihu niyo ajendeleza kulonga, <verse eid="JOB 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />Tegelezani imilosi yangu nyuwe wata ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">tegelezani vyedi nyuwe wata umanyi.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Wabunkula nkande imwile ukaidya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">ivia wongigwa ubunkule milosi ukaiva.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Elo, chisagule diya diligane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">chivane chahamwenga idyedi ni dihi.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Ayubu kagamba hana icho abalange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">mna Chohile kanusiza uwagila wangu.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Hata hegu sina lema nawoneka ni mdanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">nkwenje yangu haikuhona hata hegu sibalange.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Ni yuhi akwinga Ayubu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">Uyo mazuwa yose hakumtunya Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Ajesanya na wantu wakudamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">atimilana na wantu wata masa.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Kwaviya kagamba mntu hakupata loso lolose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">aketumbwadisa kumsankanila Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />Elo, nitegelezani, nyuwe wata umanyi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Chohile Mkulu hakudamanya wavu mpwii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Chohile Mta Nguvu hakudaha kubalanga.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Chohile amliha mntu kuligana ne izintendwa zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">amlihiza chikoda kuligana no ulujendo lwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Havikudahika Chohile Mkulu adamanye mbuli za wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">hakudaha kwazaganya uwagila wa mntu.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Hahana mntu amwinkile udahi Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Uyo ichedu nuyo akulongoza isi?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Uneva Chohile efanyanye mwenye du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">nakausa Umuye wakwe wo ujima mwe isi,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />vyumbe vyose navikabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">mntu naye nakabanika na kuya mwe idilumbi.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Ayubu uneva una umanyi tegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">tegeleza dino hukugambila.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Togola, akulongoza isi kwa miko yakwe ehiwa kudamanya uwagila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">Togola, wajeza kumkantila mkanuni na mta nguvu?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Chohile nuyo akuwagamba maseuta, nyuwe hamkuwagila chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">na vilongozi, Nyuwe mwi wavu!<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Hakuwahingiza wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">hegu kuwatunduliya wagoli ukaleka wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">kwaviya nuyo aumbile chila mntu.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Wantu awo wabanika chipumpa, chilo cha minane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">wantu wasingiswa na kujinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">wata nguvu wakomwa wakatenda wahwahwatila.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />Chohile awona ivyo wantu wakwikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">uyo awona icho wakudamanya chila zuwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Hahana chiza hegu ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">dikudaha kumtenda mkola masa efise kwa Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Chohile havikumtenda amgambile mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">chipindi cha kwita kwakwe akamkantile.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Awakoma wata nguvu hehena kuwauza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">na kuwaika watuhu ahantu hawo.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Kwaviya kamanya ivyo wakudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">awausiza izinguvu zawo nechilo nakuwakoma.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Awavyaluta mo lumpe kwachausa cho uwavu wawo,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />kwaviya waleka kumtimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">na kubela imiko yakwe yose.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Wahosa ndilo ya wachiwa imbwila Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">Chohile niyo eva indilo ya awo wasulumizwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Uneva Chohile anaunga anyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">hahana akudaha kumng'ung'uzikila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Uneva anefisa, ni yuhi namwone.<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Adamanya ivyo chani amchinde mntu mwavu alongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">hegu wadya wakuwegaila nkunto wantu watuhu.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Ayubu, kweila amasa yako kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">na kwika lagano kugamba hokole masa vituhu?<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Mlombeze Chohile akulagise uwihi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">uneva sikola masa saniwiye vituhu<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Togola, Chohile akantila seivyo weye ukunga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Waunga akudamanyize yadya ukunga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Ulamuzi ni wako, suwo wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">haluse chigambile yadya ukufanyanya weye.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Wata ubala nawazumile chiya hulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">Umo wakeva ulosi wangu nawagambe,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />Ayubu elongela akaleka kujeseza akili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">milosi yakwe haina dyodyose.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Unazuza imilosi akulonga Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">nowone kugamba alonga saviya mntu mwavu.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Hamwenga na amasa yakwe ongezeza kuhitukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">kulongozi kwetu akalagisa utilizi kwa Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Vikaheza Elihu niyo ajendeleza kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />Ayubu wafanyanya ni vyedi ukagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">sina lema kulongozi kwa Chohile,<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />uchei wamuza, “Ni loso lwani nipatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">na kubweda chibwani kwa kuleka kudamanya masa?”<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Miye nahuhitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">weye hamwenga na wambuyazo.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Kaula ko ulanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">Kaula amaingu ivyo yekulanga ukaleka weye!<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Ukakola masa, hayakumlumiza Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">Uneva ukabalanga chila nkanana, wafanyanya kugamba vyamlumiza?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Uneva wawagila, wamwinka chibwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">Hegu ahokela chintu kulawa kwako?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Wavu wako walumiza mntu mtuhu sa weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">na wedi wako wambiza watu watuhu.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />Wantu wakagwelwa ni masulumizo walombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">walombeza wambizi wakatoigwa ni wantu wata nguvu.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Mna hahana akumhitukila Chohile, mumbi ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">akuwenka msuhi mwe chipindi cha chiza.<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />Akuchihinyisa kujinka makala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">akuchitenda wabala kujinka wadege.<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Wantu awo walombeza wambizi, mna Chohile hakuwahitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">kwachausa cha wefenyi wa wantu wavu.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Chindedi Chohile Mkulu hakwetegeleza ndilo ibule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">ndilo saiyo Chohile mta nguvu hakuijela mo mtwi.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Havitendese kugamba hakwetegeleze weye ukagamba hukuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">na kugamba kumgambila kale amasulumizo yako, wenawe wamgoja.<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Iviya wagamba, Chohile achinda amaya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">hakukaula ubanasi wa wantu.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Ivyo Ayubu ajendeleza kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">milosi heine mana, walonga milosi hehena akili.<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Vikaheza Elihu ajendeleza kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />Nijijimiza hadodo miye nahulagise chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">kwaviya nichei na chakulonga kwa chausa cha Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Umanyi wangu ni mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">na kulagisa kugamba Mumbi ywangu ni mkanuni.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Kwaviya chindedi imilosi siyo yo udanti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">mta ubala chiya akulonga nichindedi.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Chohile ni mta nguvu! Mna hakubela mntu yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">hahana icho hechimanyize.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Hakuwaleka wata wavu wajendeleze no ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">mna awenka uwagila wawo wakubunyanywa.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Awadima wantu wakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">awaleka walongoze saviya maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">naho awatenda watunywe kale na kale.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Mna uneva awantu watalizwa minyolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">naho wakasulumizwa mwe yadya wadamanye,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />Chohile awalagisa uwavu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">kugamba wakola masa kwa kweduvya.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Awatenda wetegeleze amakanyo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">awalagiza waleke uwavu wawo.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Uneva wanamzumila na kumsankanila Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">nawachumilwe mwa amazuwa yawo yose.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Mna hawana mwivile, nawabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">nawabanike kwa kuswesa umanyi.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Wadya hewe kumtunya Chohile wongisa kwihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">hata wakawakantila, hawakulombeza wambizi.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Wabanika wachei wabwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">uhelo wo ujima wawo ni soni.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Mna Chohile ahinya wantu kujinkila masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">ajeseza nkunto zawo chani awahinye wammanye.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Chohile akwitanga ulawe mwe nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">chani akwike hantu hana wangalamu hehena nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">nakwike hantu hedi hehene nkunto</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">na kukwinka nkande zilozize udye.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Mna haluse wakantilwa saviya mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">wakantilwa viya vikuwagila.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Kaulisa fumbaso disekukudanta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">naho ugoli usekukwaza.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Hata ukatenda mgoli hawikale mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">ugoli haukwambize kulawa mwe nkunto.<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Use kubesa chilo chingile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">wantu wakaga aho weli.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Usinyise unase kutimila wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">kwaviya kwinkwa masulumizo wenege wavu.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Kumbuka ukulu ne izinguvu za Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">hahana akudaha kumhinya chintu.<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Hahana akudaha kumgambila Chohile cho kudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">hegu kumgamba kabalanga.<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Usekujala kutogola izintendwa zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">izo zitogolwe ni wantu.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Chila mntu kawona ayo adamanye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">mna suwe chayawona kulawa hale.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Chohile kakulisa hachikudaha kummanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">hegu kuwaza imihilimo yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Chohile nuyo akuguha amazi kulawa mwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">na kuyahitusa matwentwe ya fula.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Aitenda fula inye kulawa mwa maingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">yatwekela wantu kwa ulozo utendese.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Hahana mntu amanyize ivyo amaingu yakujenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">hegu mbaula ivyo izikululuma mo ulanga.<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Kaula ivyo akutantalika lumwemwe lumzunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">mna imizumilizo ye ibahali yatenda chiza.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Kwa fula awalisa wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">kwa kuwenka nkande ilozize.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Lumwemwe alutoza ne imikono yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">alulagiza lulenge hadya ataile.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Mbaula zakwe zatambalisa nkomano ikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">hata wanyama wamanya kugamba eza.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Umo heva inkomano iyo, umoyo wangu wazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:1">naho wapilika kwa nkama.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Woseni tegelezani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">umo akalonga idizwi dyakwe ni saviya.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Ivyo vikaheza kweza izwi dya mlulumo, izwi dya Chohile dyaluluma kwa ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">chipindi chose icho lumwemwe lwapulika pulika.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Ivyo vikaheza, dyeza izwi dyo umlulumo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">Chohile abuma kwa izwi dyakwe kulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">Umo izwi dyakwe dikabuma vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">alekekeila lumwemwe lwakwe lwa mbaula.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Chohile atowa lubaula lukwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">adamanya mbuli nkulu hechikudaha kuzikombaganya.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Alagiza balafu igwe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">na kwigala mavunde na fula nkulu.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Awachinda wantu kudamanya ndima zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">vileke wantu wose wamanye indima adamanye Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Wanyama wa kumbago wefise mwa amasaka yawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">Na kusigala mwa amalundu yawo<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Inkung'unto yalawa mwe chumba chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">na mpeho nkali yalawa ntendele ya chenya.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Kwa muye wa Chohile walavya balafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">ntendela nkulu ya amazi yasunguza kuganda.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Chohile amemeza mavunde yazamile mwe maingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">myali ya lumwemwe yaka kulawa mwa maingu.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Kwa lagizo dyakwe maingu na yazungulukila kuno na kuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">yadamanya yadya yose Chohile akuyalagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">mlanga mwe isi mwe vyumbe aumbile.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Chohile egala fula kwa kuchabaza isanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">ahamwenga egala fula kwa kuchikantila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">hegu kwa kuchilagisa ungi wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Ayubu tegeleza ulosi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">nyamala utegeleze maula ya Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Kumanya ivyo Chohile akulavya amalagizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">na ivyo akudamanya ulumwemwe lwakwe lung'ale kulawa mwa maingu?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Kuvimanya ivyo amaingu yakuyeya mo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Izo, nizo izindima zikwehela za Chohile achintile mwe umanyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Umo chivuguto cha mpeho ya kwamwenyemzi chikavumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">weye walawa mluche mwe izisuche zako uvaile.<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Togola, wadaha kuligana naye mo kutantalika ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">utogese enga shaba ichiligwe.<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Ayubu chihinye ivyo chikungwa chilonge kwa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">fanyanyi zetu ziduma, hachina dya kulonga, chimwe chiza.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Togola, ni yuhi akudaha kumgamba Chohile naunga nilonge na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">ni yuhi alonge chani akomwe?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Chipumpa mntu hakudaha kuwona pwilili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">zuwa dyefisa kunyuma kwa amaingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">haluse nkung'unto ihagila ulanga.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Chohile eza mwe ukulu ukutisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">Ung'azi wedi walawa ntendele ya chenya.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Izinguvu za Chohile zitendesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">hachikudaha kumsogeila haguhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">udahi na ukanuni wakwe ni mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">naho hakuzaganya uwagila.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Ivyo wantu wose wamtunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">kwaviya uyo hakukaula mntu yoyose akwetenda ni mta ubala.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">Chohile Amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Vikaheza, Zumbe Chohile niyo amhitula Ayubu kulaila mwe luzimu,<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />weye wi yuhi ukuza yadya hunga nidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">mwe milosi heina fanyanyi?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Kwekambe chigosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">miye nahuze ulosi, naunga unihitule.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Weye wendaga kuhi umo hadamanya isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">Hegu una ubala nigambila.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Ni yuhi aikiye ivihimo vyakwe, mafani kuvimanya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Hegu ni yuhi achuluse uluzigi mlanga mwakwe akahima?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Izinguzo zikutoza isi zichimaliswa mwe mbwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">Ni yuhi azengile idiyuwe dye chegamo?<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />Weye wendaga wiyaho hadya izintondo za mtondo zikachema chalumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">na awandima wose wa kwembingu wa Chohile wakatula chizumo kwa maizwi ya chinyemi?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />Ni yuhi aivugaile inkulujumbu ye ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">umo ibohole na kuvumila kulawa mwe imizumilizo?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Ni miye niigubike ibahali kwa maingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">na kuigubika kwa ziza kulu.<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Ibahali siikiya mihaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">na kuichinda ahantu hakwe.<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />Siigambila, “Uhelo wako ni hano, hojinke!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">Mawimbi yako makulu yahele hano.”<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />Ayubu kukongela aho welekagwa walagiza mtondo ukonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">hegu kudigambila idizuwa ditontomoke?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Togola wajezaga kuugamba ulangazi ugubike isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">na kuwabalaza wavu wose wafose mwe isi?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Umo ulangazi ukeza, wantu wawona isi yawoneka pwilili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">isula yakwe yekala saviya suche ikung'ala<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Mna wantu wavu wachindilwa ulangazi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">ulangazi wabalanga izinguvu zawo zo kudamanya wavu.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />Togola, wabulaga hasi kwe isokwe ze ibahali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">Hegu wajendaga mwe imizumilizo ye ibahali?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Togola, walagisagwa nchili za file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">hegu kuwona izinchili za ahantu hana ziza ditendese?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Togola, kumanya ukulu we isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">Nigambila hegu kuzimanya izimbuli zose izo.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Togola, wikazi wo ung'azi wikuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">ikaya ye ichiza ni kuhi?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Wadaha kuvigala uko vikwikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">hegu kuimanya isila yo kwita uko kwawo?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Chindedi kuvimanya kwaviya nakwelekwa kale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">Kwaviya kwikala mihilimo ilozize!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Togola, wengilaga ahantu hakwikwa ibalafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">hegu kuwona ahantu hakwikwa ifula ya mayuwe?<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />Ivyo sivika mpamba kwachausa kuvijeseza mwe chipindi cha ngavungavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">na kwachausa cha zuwa dya nkomano na nkondo.<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Isila ikwita ahantu lumwemwe lukupulika ni ihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">Hegu uko kukulawa nkung'unto ya ulailo wa zuwa na kuvumila mwe isi yose?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Ni yuhi atwile mifilimbi ikwita mwe mito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">ni yuhi ailagise mbaula isila yakwe mwa amaingu?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Ni yuhi akunyesa fula mlanga mwesi heine wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">mwe jangwa hekukwikalwa ni mntu?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Ni yuhi akuigusa mazi si inyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">na kuitenda ihote mani vituhu?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Vino ise dya fula ni yuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">hegu matwentwe tati yakwe ni yuhi?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Balafu ilawa kwe inda ya yuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:29">nine dya balafu ni yuhi?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Mpeho yatenda mazi yahole na kutenda saviya yuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">na ibahali itoge mwe chipindi che mpeho.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />Togola, wadaha kuzitaliza minyolo izi ntondo za Kilimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">hegu kutohola viya vikutoza izintondo zikwitangwa Olioni?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Togola, wadaha kuzilongoza izintondo mwe ichipindi chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">hegu kudilongoza idikala dikwitangwa Dubu na wanawe?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Togola, izisigilizi zikulongoza uko kulanga kuzimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">wadaha kuzikiya vyo kudamanya mwe isi?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Togola wadaha kugutila kuyalagiza amaingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">yanyese fula imgubike?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Togola, unalagiza lumwemwe lupulike hantu ukunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">lwadaha kukwizila na kukugamba, “Chemalanya chite hohose ukunga?”<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Ni yuhi ajeile ubala mwa awantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">chani wakombaganye vintu?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Ni yuhi mta akili ya kuwaza amaingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">hegu ni yuhi akudaha kuyajida amaguduliya uko kwembingu yanyese fula,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />umo amalumbi yakatenda yatozana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">na ulongo utozane na kutenda ntope?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Wadaha kumchesekela simba maingo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">hegu kuwegusa wana simba,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />umo wakwefisa mwa amalundu yawo hegu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">umo wakefisa wakanyatila?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Ni yuhi akuyenka makungulu nkande yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">umo amachinda yawo yakanilila sala miye Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">na kuzunguluka kuno na kuno kwa chausa cha kuswesa nkande?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />Togola, ichipindi cho kweleka izingulugulu kwamagulu kuchimanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">Hegu wawonaga nkongoni ikeleka?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Togola, kumanya zenula nda kwa chipindi chani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">Hegu idizuwa dyenye dyo kweleka kwawo kudimanya?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Kumanya ivyo zikwinama zikeleka awana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">vikaheza usungu wo kweleka wasila.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Awana wawo wakwila kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">wakaheza wawasa wamami zawo, hawakuya vituhu.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Ni yuhi akuzilekeila mpunda ya kumba mbago?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Ni yuhi akuzileka zejendele uko zikunga?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Miye nuyo nizinkile idijangwa ditende wikazi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">na luwala luna lumunyu lutende wikazi wawo.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Izo zenega vitendese na mizi ina lwasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">hahana mntu akudaha kuziguha azidamanyize ndima.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Zaita kwa magulu kwe kulonda nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">zakulonda chintu chochose chibisi chani zidye.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Togola, mbogo wadaha kuidamanyiza ndima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">Hegu, yadaha kwikala mwe dewa dyako nechilo?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Togola, mbogo wadaha kuitaliza sigi ikulimile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">Hegu ikwese jembe dya kulimila kwe nkonde?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Togola noyegamile kwaviya ina maguvu yatendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">noileke ikudamanyize ndima zako nkulu?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Togola, mbogo wadaha witende ikwigaile ulozo wako kaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">na kuwigala ahantu ho kuhugusiza?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Kaula mbuguni ivyo ikwedenya ikavinya amawawa yakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">Mna haikudaha kupuluka saviya mzinge.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Mbuguni yasa amatagi yakwe mlanga mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">vileke yabwikane moto mwe sanga.<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Haikumanya kugamba yadaha yajatwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">hegu kutulwa ni wanyama wa kumbago.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Mbuguni yawadamanyiza unyakwili wanawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">wadaha ugambe sawo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">hakuvisinya hata hegu wakabanika.<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Ni miye niitendile hezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">simwinkile ubala wowose.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Mna mbuguni inakonga kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">yagulukisa kujinka falasi na mkwela falasi.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Togola, falasi zinkigwa nguvu ni weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">Na kuzikiya mazoya matali mwe izisingo zawo?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Togola, ni weye ukuitenda falasi ipilike kulanga uge sije,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">na kuwatisa wantu no umwilo wakwe?<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Wachakula isanga vihiye mwa amakolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">zefenyeza izinguvu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">zajendeleza kulongozi zikagombe nkondo.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Zeduvya kuno hezikogaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">hata zikatiswa na sime hazikuya kunyuma.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Iviziha wakwinula wakwela falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">vyahamizana naho zapulika mwe idizuwa.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Falasi yajendeleza kulongozi kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">naho hazikuchimala kwa izwi dya magunda yakatoigwa.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Chila gunda dikatoigwa, zalavya maizwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">Zeva mpofa ya nkondo kulawa hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">zeva amaizwi ya wakulu we nkondo wakazitanga.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Togola mwewe uhinywa ni weye ukupuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">na kuchulusa amawawa yakwe kuhinga kwamwenyemzi?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Togola magushu ya puluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">na kuzenga sasa dyakwe ko lunenengwe kwa lagizo dyako?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Magushu yaika wikazi wawo mwe nyuwe ntali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">nyuwe zisongoke mbulo nizo izinchinga zawo.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Kulawa uko dyataila maingo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">ameso yakwe yawona kulawa hale.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Gushu dikaheza kukoma mnyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">amachinda yafyosa isakame ya mnyama uyo.<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Zumbe ajendele kumuza Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Weye Ayubu ukuhigana na miye mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">wadaha kumliganya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Weye mta kumfuzumila Chohile, elo mhitule!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Akaheza Ayubu niyo amhitula Zumbe Chohile,<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Miye sikuwagila, nahuhitule mbwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">Sanilonge chintu chochose.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Silongesa kujinka viya nahaungwa nilonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">elo, sanilonge vituhu.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga na Ayubu vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:6">kujinkila mwe luzimu, amgamba,<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />Kwekambe uchimale chigosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">miye nahuze ulosi naunga unihitule.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Togola, wahitwila inkanto yangu, uniwone miye nna mlema chani weye usekutenda na lema?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Weye una udahi saviya miye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">Wadaha ubume saviya ulubaula lwangu?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Elo, kwelagise ung'azi na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">kwevise ukuka na ujimbiko.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Mlagise amaya yako yatendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">mkaule mta kweduvya umgwise.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Wakaule wata kwefenya uwaseleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">wajate wata wavu hohose weli.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Wahambe wose mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">wagubike izinyuso zawo na kuwajela mwe si ya wabanike.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Aho, nahubunkule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">kugamba udahi wako ukwinka uhuda.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Kaula diya idikala dikwitangwa Benamosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">sidyumba idyo iviya sikumba weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">Dyadya mani uge ng'ombe,<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />mna mo umwili wakwe dina nguvu zitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">naho nyuje ze inda yakwe zijimbala!<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Umchila wakwe wavina vina saviya mti wa mwelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">na izinyuje za amawambo yakwe zisumilwa chalumwe.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Amavuha yakwe yatoga saviya mabomba ya shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">ivitago vyakwe vikala saviya mikuwo ya chuma.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Idyo dyendaga dya nkongo mwa amaula ye ivyumbe vyangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">Miye ichedu nidumbile ni miye hudaha kudihuma.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Magulu yalavya nkande yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">aho wakudigilika wanyama wa kumbago.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Dyagona mwe luwala luna miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">na kwefisa mwe matete mnkanda mwe mazi.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Dyekala mwe mpeho za masaka yana miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">na mwe mpeho za miti ikuhota mnkanda mwe mito.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Hadikogoha mazi yakuguluka mwe imito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">hadikutisika hata umto wa Yolodani ukamema mazi na kudigubika umlomo wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Ni yuhi akudaha kudiziba ameso na kudigwila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">Ni yuhi akudaha kudigwila na kudiponkola impula yakwe?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />Togola! Wadaha kudilowa idikala idyo kwa ndwana ya kulowela samaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">hegu kudinyinya luzigi mo lulimi lwakwe?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Togola, wadaha kujisa luzigi mwe impula yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">hegu kuponkola ulusaya lwakwe na ndwana?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Togola dyadaha dikweile udilekeile dite?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">Hegu dyadaha dikulombeze udifile mbazi?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Togola, dyadaha kwika lagano na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">dikusankanile weye mazuwa yose?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Togola, wadaha kudinyinya luzigi uge kadege,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">hegu kudinyinya luzigi disezigilwe ni wandele wako?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Wataga mayombe wadaha kudidamanyiza yombe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">Wataga mayombe wadaha kudihanya hanya waditage?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Togola, wadaha kuditunga umtwi wakwe kwa mshenge wa kulowela samaki?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 41:7">Umemeze umkota wakwe kwa mitunga hegu wadaha wa kulowela samaki.?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Unaika umkono wako mlanga mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">nogwelwe ni nkondo hoijale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">hojeze kuwiya vituhu mpwii! <verse eid="JOB 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Mntu akuditisa adamanya ndima ya bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">mntu anadiwona du engilwa ni nkama na kugwa hasi.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Hahana mkankalu akudaha kudinula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">Elo, ni yuhi akudaha kuchimala kulongozi kwangu.<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Mo mlomo wakwe mwalawa myale ya ikwaka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">Masese ya moto yadalika kuse.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Sanileke kulonga mwe iviga vye idikala idyo Lewisani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">nguvu zakwe no umwili wakwe wedi.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Ni yuhi akudaha kudikula amagwalatu yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">hegu kudisogeila na kinchofu adilongoze?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Ni yuhi akudaha kuvugula umlomo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">uzungulukwe ni meno yakutisa?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Magwalatu yakwe yalumankanywa hamwenga yatogesa saviya chuma naho hayakusingisika.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Kwaivyo yalumankanywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">hata mpeho haikudaha kujinka hagatigati.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Yalunganywa hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">hayakudaha kusentwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Dikajela mitisha kwalawa ulangazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">meso yakwe yaka saviya myale ya zuwa dikutontomoka.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Myali ikwaka yalawa mo mlomo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">masese yapulika kuse. <verse eid="JOB 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Mwe izimpula zakwe mwalawa mosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">uge nyungu ikutipwilika mwe moto.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Dikahema muye wakwe wadaha ujimbile moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">mo mlomo wakwe mwalawa myali ya moto.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Isingo yakwe imema nguvu zitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">umo dikajenda dyogofya wantu.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Nyuje ne iminofu yakwe vilumankanywa hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">itoga haikudaha kuswa.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Ichifuwa chakwe chitoga saviya luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">chitoga saviya yuwe dya kusagila.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Umo dikenuka wakankalu wogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">dikakonga kujenda wasumka.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Hahana sime ikudaha kudisenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">hahana guha hegu msale vikudaha kudikoma.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Idyo kwakwe chuma ni saviya zani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:27">shaba kwakwe yenga mti uwoile.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Hahana msale ukudaha kuditenda dinyilike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:28">nkumbayuwe kwakwe ni saviya mahofya.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Lungu kwakwe ni saviya zani dinyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:29">mntu akadikuntila guha dyaseka.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Ntendele za hasi mwe inda yakwe zina magweno gweno saviya mazaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">zaika mbuluzo mwe ntagata uge chiya cha kuhetela.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Dyasindika imizumilizo ye bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:31">saviya mavuta yakutipwilika mwe nyungu.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Dinajinka kunyuma dyasa msilimbo ukumweka.,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:32">Mntu adaha agambe umzumilizo una fi.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Muno mwe isi hahana chintu chikudaha kuliganya na idyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:33">ni chumbe hechigoha chochose.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Dyabela awanyama awatuhu wose wakweduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:34">idyo ni seuta dya amakala yose yakweduvya.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amhitula Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Vikaheza Ayubu niyo amhitula Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />Simanya kugamba weye Zumbe Chohile una nguvu vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">wadaha kudamanya mbuli yoyose ukunga.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Wauza ivyo nijezize kuhiga ubala wako chihezi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Chindedi silonga chintu chiya sichimanyize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">mabuli yakulise ayo sayamanyaga.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />“Nakugamba, ‘Tegeleza, weye nonigambile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">nonuze miye huhitule.’ <verse eid="JOB 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Nevaga wantu umo wakanigambila, mna haluse sikuwona miye mwenye. <verse eid="JOB 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Elo, singila soni mwa yose nilongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">nakweila kwa kwehaka lumbi na maivu.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Zumbe Chohile eze abinde kulonga na Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:7">niyo amgamba Elifazi mntu kulawa komzi wa Temani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:7">“Sikwihiwa weye na wambuyazo waidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:7">kwaviya hamlongile ichindedi mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:7">saviya mndima ywangu Ayubu adamanye.<verse eid="JOB 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Haluse guhani majeku mfungate na ndolome mfungate mwite kwa mndima ywangu Ayubu, mkalavye malavyo ya kutikimya kwachausa chenyu. Mndima ywangu Ayubu nawalombezezeni, miye nanetegeleze amalombezo yakwe, nami sanileke kuwadamanyiza vikuligana no uhezi wenyu. Nyuwe hamlongile chindedi mwangu saviya alongile.”<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Ivyo, Elifazi na Bilidadi mwikazi ywa Shuwa na Sofali mwikazi ywa Naamati niyo wadamanya saviya Zumbe Chohile alongile, Zumbe Chohile niyo ahitula amalombezo ya Ayubu. <verse eid="JOB 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Ayubu eze awalombezeze wambuyaze watatu, Zumbe Chohile niyo amchumiza vituhu saviya endile nkongo na kumwinka nkanana mbili kujinka aho nkongo. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Wakuluze na walumbuze dya Ayubu na wendaga wambuyaze wamtalamkilaga kwakwe na kudya naye. Wamwinka hai na kumjele moyo kwa yadya amasulumizo yose Zumbe Chohile amtendele. Chila yumwenga niyo amwinka hela na mpete ya zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Mwe imihilimo ya Ayubu itongele Zumbe Chohile niyo amjimbikisa kujinka ivyo amjimbikaga aho nkongo. Elo, Ayubu endaga na ngoto elufu mlongo umwenga na nne na ngamiya elufu mtandatu na ng'ombe elufu mbili na mpunda elufu imwenga. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Iviya endaga na wana chilume mfungate na wana chiche watatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Mwanawe umkulu ywe chiche amwitangaga zina dya Yemima na ywa kaidi kamwitanga Keziya ywo udumo kamwitanga Keleni hapuki. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Mwe isi yose hakwendaga na wandele watana kujinka awana chiche wa Ayubu. Tati yawo kawasiza ulisi awandele awo saviya awasize wakulu zawo. <verse eid="JOB 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Vize viheze Ayubu niyo ekala mihilimo gana na milongo mine, kawawona wezukulu ne ivilembwe vyakwe kubula lweleko lwa kane. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Vikaheza niyo abanika akatenda kadalahalisa.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>